!!
!!IF I # 0 DO STUFF W/BAT'RCN = I
!!CLEAR BAT'TRY'POST WHEN DONE ..., RELEASE RECORD ...
!!
!!      REVISION HISTORY:
!!
!!7.2   12/06/88 ASC    New version created
!!
!![1] 06/13/89 KJS/ESE  Fixed rounding bug in last WOE record
!!
!![2] 08/03/89 KJS      Fixed carpet interface distribution.
!!
!![3] 10/10/89 ESE      Use old number only if requested.
!!
!![4] 01/26/90 ESE      Use UKY for P.O. number if desired.
!!
!![5] 07/05/90 ESE      Deal with missing WPA (wholesale garment only).
!!
!![6] 07/23/90 ESE      Allow for items that include tax in sales price.
!!
!![7] 07/31/90 ESE      Speed it up by memory basing the DST posting.
!!
!![8] 08/14/90 ESE/HEIDI Fix (?) VAT combined with included tax.
!!
!![9] 09/14/90 HEIDI    Added error checking for WOE file access
!!
!![10] 11/28/90 ESE     Speed up T-Shirt area.
!!
!![11] 12/03/90 ESE     Caching to speed it up.
!!
!![12] 12/06/90 MCT     Allow creation of invoice and inventory batch by
!!                      Promise Date.
!!
!![13] 12/12/90 KJS/HLB Repaired totalling problem cause by [10]
!!
!![14] 12/13/90 KJS     Fixed [12] to send correct date.
!!
!![15] 03/14/91 ESE     Cache WOE records.
!!
!![16] 03/18/91 BAP     Fixed invlaid GL/PLN error message
!!
!![17] 03/20/91 ESE     Allow posting during end-of-day.
