!![18] 04/04/91 HLB     Was sending ship-to alt. address to A/R.
!!
!![19] 05/07/91 KJS     Corrected FINDYR/FINDPR macros for FUNKY date ranges.
!!
!![20] 05/15/91 ESE/HLB More VAT tax stuff.
!!
!![21] 05/29/91 HLB     Problem with changing unapplied PO from OE info
!!                      to ORG'NO
!![22] 06/27/91 ESE     Add setting of terms from APA file:
!!                      MUST modify data on A/R terms!!!
!!                      VCR:ARC7:TRHFIL.CPY
!![23] 07/03/91 ESE     Set DOC date from header post date.
!!
!![24] 07/18/91 HLB     Expanded the "Sorry, ..." aging error message
!!
!![25] 08/02/91 HLB     If deleting the original DOC, use the same
!!                      batch and transaction as before.
!!
!![26] 08/02/91 HLB     VAT still not quite right
!!
!![27] 09/03/91 ESE     Make work with new credit checking.
!!
!![28] 10/22/91 ESE      Compute sales tax different for pickups (TTLSTX[5]).
!!
!![29] 10/30/91 MCT/HLB Commission group defaulting incorrect.
!!
!![30] 11/05/91 ESE     Post applied credit to A/R.
!!
!![31] 11/20/91 HLB     When generating/validating invoice numbers, needed
!!                      to check archives as well as current DOC's.
!!
!![32] 11/26/91 ESE     For setting of APA'NO make customer APA number
!!                      secondary to terms APA number.
!!
!!
!![33] 12/02/91 HLB     Modified [25] to use original DOC trn when deleting
!!                      even if batch came from OE.
!!
!![34] 12/10/91 ESE/HLB Put a message on duplicate posted invoices.
!!
!![35] 02/18/92 ESE     Try to make cash applications nicer.
!!
!![36] 02/20/92 ESE     Support task manager printing.
!!
!![37] 02/25/92 ESE     Little rounding problem  fixed.
!!
!![38] 02/27/92 ESE     Post freight correctly to multiple product lines.
!!
!![39] 03/11/92 ESE     Still trying to post freight for multi prod lines.
!!
!!7.3a 03/17/92 ESE     New WGP, SUB, & LIN stuff.
!!
!![40] 04/21/92 ESE     Use macro to compute net line item.
!!
!![41] 05/06/92 ESE     Attempt to stop duplicate invoices when not posting
!!                      to A/R. MUST INCLUDE OERCTL 7.3A(75) WITH THIS!
!!
!![42] 05/06/92 ESE/HLB COMNET.MAC was wrong (invalid invoice/distribution).
!!
!![43] 05/14/92 HLB/ESE When doing in EOD, would assign new invoice number
!!                      instead of use original
!!
!![44] 05/18/92 HLB/ESE Only delete document from A/R if the customers
!!                      match.
!!
!![45] 06/17/92 ESE/HLB Fix: so that when multiple pay/cr memos are applied
!!                      they don't disappear.
!!
!![46] 07/27/92 ESE     Unix fix.
!!
!![47] 10/13/92 ESE/HLB NEW:  check more carefully for old DOC records on a
!!                            repost, don't add DOCL key, try to use old
!!                            DOC record if no changes.
!!
!![48] 12/29/92 ESE     FIX:  Set DOCA properly so that DOCP will be handled
!!                            properly in A/R post if cash applied to order.
!!
!![49] 01/04/93 ESE     FIX:  Problems when cash and credit memos applied
!!                            to the order.
!!
!![50] 01/15/93 ESE     FIX:  More problems when cash & cr memos applied.
!!
!![51] 03/03/93 ESE     NEW:  Release BSC record.
!!
!![52] 05/18/93 ESE     NEW:  opens on journals and work files.
!!
!![53] 05/20/93 ESE     NEW: remove AFR file.
!!                      IH: must accomany OEPEOD, OERCTL, AR1AR3, AR1BAT
!!
!![54] 05/20/93 ESE/HLB NEW: update CAP file here.
!!                      IH: must accompany OEPQTY
!!
!![55] 06/29/93 ESE     NEW: auto determine if old invoice number to be
!!                      used if posted.
!!
!![56] 08/05/93 ESE     NEW: New PRH caching
!!                      IH: need VICSIT.SBR 7.3a(7) and a lot of other
!!                          programs (see ESEPRH.CMD).
!!
!![57] 08/25/93 ESE     NEW: SRLC key added.
!!
!![58] 09/14/93 HLB     FIX: Change to BATBSC macro to better verify that
!!                      nothing can be added to the current file that is
!!                      already in the archive file.
!!
!![59] 10/28/93 ESE     NEW: new error trapping for gracefull ctrl-c.
!!
!![60] 11/23/93 HLB     NEW: Allow more than one unapplied batch.
!!
!![61] 04/01/94 ESE/HLB NEW: differentiate between blank and zero on location
!!                      setting of ptc & cst.
!!
!![62] 05/13/94 HLB     NEW: Delete unapplied record if entirely applied.
!!
!![63] 07/06/94 HLB     FIX: Corrected application problem causing
!!                      DOCA key corruption.
!!
!![64] 08/18/94 ESE/HLB NEW: Credit card handling
!!
!![65] 09/28/94 ESE     NEW: If customer not taxable and tax was charged
!!                      use A/R control record to get G/L account.
!!
!!7.4 01/06/95 ESE      NEW: Implement "slip" pricing (see OEC'SLIP'PRICE).
!!
!![1] 03/02/95 HLB      FIX: Undocumented improvements to credit card
!!                      handling.  Send with OERCTL, OE1WGA, and OE2CRE
!!
!![2] 02/16/95 HLB      FIX: Corrected a MC credit card credit transaction
!!                      problem (see [66] in 12/oe).
!!
!![3] 12/04/95 HLB      FIX: Problems with applying cash to split credit
!!                      card orders.
!!
!![4] 12/27/95 ESE      NEW: attemp to fix link problem using xcall system.
!!
!![5] 01/02/96 ESE      FIX: FINDYR macro incorrect if AR not matching GL.
!!
!![6] 06/26/96 ESE      NEW: Inform AR1OEU who we are - MUST have matching
!!                      AR1OEU.RUN!!!
!!
!![7] 10/11/96 CAE      FIX: Mapped unmapped variable
!!
!!8.0  03/31/97 CAE     New version created
!!
!![8]  03/31/97 CAE     NEW: Changes for year 2000.
!!
!![9]  05/14/97  ESE    NEW: Used ADDL
!!
!![10] 05/20/97  ESE   FIX: linker.cpy preserves PRT and LOC records.
!!
!!
!![11] 06/10/97  ESE   FIX: write/nolock error fixed in vics.mac
!!
!![12] 09/22/97 SLM     NEW: Recompile with new BATBSC.MAC  This macro has
!!                           been modified to search for gaps in AR batch
!!                           numbers when the customer reaches 9999 batch.
!!                           Requires environment variables ARGAP = "Y" and
!!                           you can set a start batch with ARGAPBCH = ????
!!                           or whatever start batch you want.
!!

\\SSRPTMAPS                     !!Standard report module maps
GLOBAL SS'REPORT = "N"
!!
COPY    "FORMAD"
!!
\COPYF  LHS MODE="PRI"
!!\COPYF  HHS OE HHS2 MODE="DTA"
\COPYF  TRM AR MODE="PRI"
\COPYF  DOC AR
\COPYF  DOC AR DOC2
\COPYF  DOC AR DOC3
\COPYF  DOC AR DOC4                                             !![62]
\COPYF  DHS AR                                                  !![31]
\COPYF  BSC AR
\COPYF  BAT AR
\COPYF  BHS AR
\COPYF  CHK AR
\COPYF  BAT AR BAT2
\COPYF  DST AR
\COPYF  DST AR DST2
\COPYF  AGE AR
\COPYF  AGE AR AGE2 MODE="KEY"
!!
\COPYF  PRH IN MODE="PRI"
\COPYF  APA IN MODE="PRI"
\COPYF  CGL IN MODE="PRI"
\COPYF  TBL IN MODE="PRI"
\COPYF  STX IN STX2 MODE="PRI"
\COPYF  MSG SY                                          !![7]
!!
MAP1 CNETP,B,5
MAP1 CNETD,B,5
MAP1 QQ,F
MAP1 ZZ,F
MAP1 LAST'SEQ,B,2
MAP1 TTL'QTY,B,5
!!
COPY    "CVTMAP"
!!
!!MISC MAPS

MAP1    LAST'TRN,B,2
MAP1    LAST'TRN2,B,2
MAP1    LAST'CHK'SEQ,B,2
MAP1    APPLY'AMT,F
MAP1    SAV'BO,B,5
MAP1    SAV'PRICE,B,5
MAP1    SAV'DISC,B,5
MAP1    SHP'PRICE,B,5
MAP1    SHP'DISC,B,5
MAP1    SAV'STX1ABLE,B,5
MAP1    SAV'STX2TOTAL,B,5
MAP1    CAT'NO,B,2
MAP1    APA'NO,B,2
MAP1    TAX'PERC,F
MAP1    SAV'RCN,B,4
MAP1    APPLY'ERROR,B,1
MAP1    LAST'PLN'NO,B,2
MAP1    LAST'STX'NO,B,2
MAP1    LAST'CMG'NO,B,3
MAP1    NEW'INTERNAL,B,3
MAP1    TQTY,B,5
MAP1    SQTY,B,5
MAP1    QFACTOR,F
MAP1    PFACTOR,F
MAP1    DFACTOR,F
MAP1    BFACTOR,F
MAP1    WORK'NET,B,5
MAP1    BY'PLN(7),S,7
MAP1    BOX'ORDER(7),S,1
LCL1    BS'STX1,B,5                                             !![6]
LCL1    BS'TOTAL,B,5                                            !![8]
LCL1    SAV'BAT'RCN,B,4
LCL1    SAV'BAT2'RCN,B,4

MAP1    ACT
        MAP2    MACT,B,2
        MAP2    PTC,B,2
        MAP2    CST,B,2

MAP1    LAST'ACT
        MAP2    LMACT,B,2
        MAP2    LPTC,B,2
        MAP2    LCST,B,2

MAP1 TWOE'TOTALS,S
        MAP2 OVR'STX
                MAP3    TSTX1FINAL,B,5
                MAP3    TSTX2FINAL,B,5
        MAP2 OVR'STX2,@OVR'STX
                MAP3    TSTX(2),B,5

        MAP2 OVR'DISC
                MAP3    TDISC,B,5
                MAP3    TODISC,B,5
                MAP3    TRETRO,B,5
        MAP2 OVR'DISC2,@OVR'DISC
                MAP3    TDISCS(3),B,5

        MAP2    TSTX1'TAXABLE,B,5               !![20]

        MAP2    TCD(6),B,5
        MAP2    TVIA'SUM(2),B,5
        MAP2    TOLD'DR,B,5
        MAP2    TOLD'CR,B,5
        MAP2    TOLD'CASH,B,5
        MAP2    TTOTAL,B,5
        MAP2    TTBL'AMT(7),B,5
        MAP2    TWOE'COUNT,B,2

!!BELOW USED IN AGING.CPY[SR]

MAP1    II,F
!![7]   MAP1    LAST'SEQ,B,2
MAP1    LAST'RCN,B,4
MAP1    LAST'DUE'RCN,B,4
MAP1    OCCUR,F
MAP1    AMT,B,5
MAP1    WRH'FILL'YN,S,1,"N"
MAP1    BALANCE,B,5
MAP1    PAID,B,5
MAP1    J,F

ON ERROR GOTO PRE'ERTRAP

OEPDOC:
BEGIN:
        \LNKIN

                                !!MODIFY:  below if program name changed ...
        IF PRGNAM = "OEXDO2" THEN
                WRH'FILL'YN = "Y"
                PRGNAM = "OEXDOC"
        ENDIF

MAP1 FROM'OE2CRE,S,1
        XCALL GETENV,"FROM_OE2CRE",FROM'OE2CRE

        IF FROM'OE2CRE # "Y" THEN FROM'OE2CRE = "N"
        MAP1 FNAME,S,100
        XCALL GETENV,"BAGGER_DEBUG",FNAME
        IF LEN(FNAME) <= 1 OR FNAME = "N" THEN
            FNAME = "/logs/oepdoc.DAILY"
        ELSE
            XCALL VICSIT,-107,FNAME
        ENDIF

        IF PRGNAM = "OEPEO2" THEN               !![17]
                WRH'FILL'YN = "Y"               !![17]
                PRGNAM = "OEPDOC"               !![17]
        ENDIF                                   !![17]

        IF PRGNAM # "OEPDOC" AND PRGNAM # "OEXDOC" THEN
                ENTRY = "Cannot run program directly"
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
        ENDIF

        LDUSR                   !!DO NOT NOT NOT USE SECURITY IN THIS PROGRAM
        IF V''SYSTEM = "AMOS" THEN
                IF V''JOBNAM[1;4] = "TASK" THEN IN'TB = 1
        ELSE
                IF UB'UID[1;4] = "TASK" THEN IN'TB = 1
        ENDIF
        IF V''JOBNAM[1;3] = "BGP" THEN IN'TB = 1
        \READCTL APP="AR"
        USE OC2 UB'CNO INTO OC2'REC
        MAP1 BAGGER'BQUEUE,S,1
        XCALL GETENV,"BQUEUE",BAGGER'BQUEUE
        IF BAGGER'BQUEUE >= "1" AND BAGGER'BQUEUE <= "9" THEN
            ENTRY = ""
            \ADDPATH OUTPUT="ENTRY" APID="WL" MODE="P"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + "x/bagger"+BAGGER'BQUEUE+".xml"
            \DG LOADFILE BAGGER ENTRY ENTRY
            IF DG'CTL = 0 THEN
                \DG GETCHILD BAGGER monitor MONITOR
                IF DG'CTL # 0 THEN
                    ENTRY = "Must set up monitor in "+ENTRY
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                    CALL DO'ERRL
                    GOTO ABORT
                ENDIF

                \DG GETVALUE MONITOR ipc_mqid MON'MQID
                IF DG'CTL # 0 THEN
                    ENTRY = "Must set up ipc_mqid in monitor in "+ENTRY
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                    CALL DO'ERRL
                    GOTO ABORT
                ENDIF
            ENDIF
        ENDIF

!!NOTE:  HDR is already locked ... leave that way

        IF HDR'PQU'STAT # "Q" OR HDR'ACTION = SPACE THEN
                ENTRY = "Invalid HDR: "
                \HDRERR APID="OE"
                ENTRY = "Invalid HDR: PQU'STAT= "+HDR'PQU'STAT+" ACTION "+HDR'ACTION
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                CALL DO'ERRL
                GOTO ABORT
        ENDIF
        CALL SET'VICS'PTRS
        IF REPOSTING # 2 THEN
                HHS'RCN = I
                HHS'REC = HDR'REC
        ELSE
                RDLOCK HHS HDR'RCN INTO HHS'REC
        ENDIF
        IF WRH'FILL'YN = "Y" THEN                       !![17]
                NEW'INTERNAL = HHS'INTERNAL             !![17]
        ENDIF                                           !![17]

        IF HHS'PROC = 5 THEN
                CALL CLEAN'UP
                END                     !!NO DOC FOR SHOP ORDER
        ENDIF

        IF HHS'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "Cannot read archived header: "
                IF REPOSTING # 2 THEN
                        \HDRERR APID="OE"
                ELSE
                        ENTRY = ENTRY + ":" + REPOSTING + " RCN="+HDR'RCN
                ENDIF
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                CALL DO'ERRL
                GOTO ABORT
        ENDIF

!!      HHS2'REC = HHS'REC

MAP1 ORG'YEAR,B,1,0                                     !![25]
MAP1 ORG'PERIOD,B,1,0                                   !![25]
MAP1 ORG'BATCH,B,2,0                                    !![25]
MAP1 ORG'TRN,B,2,0                                      !![25]
MAP1 ORG'DTT,B,3,0                                      !![25]
MAP1 CCAMT,B,5

        IF REPOSTING # 0 CALL DEL'OLD'DOC
!![54] - below
        COPYF "CAPFIL",=CAP2,NOAFR
        IF OEC'LOG'CRM = "Y" THEN
                CALL DO'HDRSUM
                IF DOC'AMT > 0 THEN
                        CAP'SPACE = SPACE
                        CAP'HDR'LOC'NO = HHS'LOC'NO
                        CAP'DOC'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
                        CAP'HDR'NO = HHS'NO
                        CAP'SHIPMENT = HHS'SHIPMENT
                        CAP'DTT = DATE
                        CAP'IDTT = DATE
                        IF HHS'HOLD'YN = "O" THEN
                                CAP'UID = "~ERROR"
                        ELSE
                                CAP'UID = "~AUTO"
                        ENDIF
                        \SETKEY CAP MODE="KEY"
                        ADD CAP FROM CAP'REC KEY CAP'KEY
                        IF CAP'CTL = 0 THEN
                                \SETKEY CAP MODE="KY2"
                                \ADDKEY CAP MODE="KY2"
                        ELSE
                                CAP2'REC = CAP'REC
                                RDLOCK CAP INTO CAP'REC KEY CAP'KEY
                                IF HHS'HOLD'YN = "O" THEN
                                        CAP2'DTT = CAP'DTT
                                        CAP2'UID = CAP'UID
                                ELSE
                                        CAP'UID = "~AUTO"
                                ENDIF
                                IF CAP'REC # CAP2'REC THEN
                                        \SETKEY CAP MODE="KY2"
                                        CAP'REC = CAP2'REC
                                        \UPDKEY CAP MODE="KY2"
                                        WRITE CAP FROM CAP'REC
                                ELSE
                                        REL CAP
                                ENDIF
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
!![54] - above

        FOR I = 1 TO 7
                IF VIA'TBL'NO(I) # 0 THEN
                        TBL'KNO = VIA'TBL'NO(I)
                        \VUSE TBL - V''PTR1
                        IF TBL'CTL = 0 THEN
                                IF VIA'SHP'FLAG = 1 AND TBL'BOX'ORDER = "B" THEN
                                        TBL'BOX'ORDER = "O"
                                ENDIF
                                BY'PLN(I) = TBL'BY'PLN'YN
                                BOX'ORDER(I) = TBL'BOX'ORDER
                        ELSE
                                ENTRY = "Invalid TBL: "+VIA'TBL'NO(I)+ "/ HHS="
                                \LINERR PRE="LHS" APID="OE"
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                                GOTO ABORT
                        ENDIF
                ELSE
                        BY'PLN(I) = "?"
                        BOX'ORDER(I) = "?"
                ENDIF
        NEXT I

        CALL GET'SF'TAXABLE
        IF CUS'TAXABLE = "Y" OR CUS'TAXABLE = "S" OR SF = 0 THEN
            TSTSTX = "S"
            CALL COMPUTE'TTL'STX'PERC
            TAX'PERC = TTL'STX'PERC
        ELSE
            TAX'PERC = 0
        ENDIF
        LHS'KHDR'LOC'NO = HHS'LOC'NO
        LHS'KDOC'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
        LHS'KHDR'NO = HHS'NO
        LHS'KSHIPMENT = HHS'SHIPMENT
        LHS'KNO = -1
        USE LHS INTO LHS'REC KEY LHS'KEY
        GETPRV LHS INTO LHS'REC
        \CHKKEY PRE="LHS"
        CCAMT = 0
        IF LHS'CTL = 0 AND LHS'TRK'NO = OC2'TRK'NO THEN
                                    !!Get credit card amount in LAST LHS
            CCAMT = LHS'NET
        ENDIF

!!      CALL ZTOTAL

        CALL FIND'BAT'DOC                       !!Must always do this
                                                !!Even if reposting
        BS'STX1 = 0                             !![6]
        BS'TOTAL = 0                            !![8]
!![11] - all of below
        LWOE'RCN = 0
        LWOE'II = 0
        IF CACHE'TEST = "YES" AND CACHE'LHS'CNT <= CACHE'MAX1 THEN
                FOR LHS'II = 1 TO CACHE'LHS'CNT
                        LHS'REC = CACHE'LHS'REC(LHS'II)
                        PRH'KTRK'NO = LHS'TRK'NO                !![20]
                        CALL FIND'PRH
                        IF PRH'CTL # 0 THEN
!!SHOULD NEVER EVER HAPPEN ... BUT JUST IN CASE ...
                                ENTRY  = "Part not found: "
                                \KERROR PRE="LHS" APID="OE"
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                                ENTRY  = "Part not found in LHS: "+LHS'TRK'NO
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                        ELSE
                                IF LHS'COM'QTY # 0 THEN
                                    CALL ADD'WOE
                                ENDIF
                        ENDIF
                NEXT LHS'II
                LHS'CTL = 3
        ELSE
                LHS'KHDR'LOC'NO = HHS'LOC'NO
                LHS'KDOC'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
                LHS'KHDR'NO = HHS'NO
                LHS'KSHIPMENT = HHS'SHIPMENT
                LHS'KNO = 0
                USE LHS INTO LHS'REC KEY LHS'KEY
                DO
                        GETNXT LHS INTO LHS'REC
                        \CHKKEY PRE="LHS"
                        IF LHS'CTL # 0 EXIT
                        PRH'KTRK'NO = LHS'TRK'NO        !![20]
                        CALL FIND'PRH                   !![11]
                        IF PRH'CTL # 0 THEN
!!SHOULD NEVER EVER HAPPEN ... BUT JUST IN CASE ...
                                ENTRY  = "Part not found: "
                                \HDRERR PRE="HHS" APID="OE"
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                                ENTRY  = "Part not found: TRK'NO = "+PRH'KTRK'NO
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""
!!Invalid Distribution?
                                ENTRY  = "Part not found: TRK'NO="+PRH'KTRK'NO+" LHS'KEY="
                                \KERROR LHS MODE="D" CNO="N" APID="OE"
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""
                                REPEAT
                        ENDIF
                        IF LHS'COM'QTY = 0 THEN
!!Invalid Distribution?
                                ENTRY  = "LHS'COM'QTY=0 TRK'NO="+PRH'KTRK'NO+" LHS'KEY="
                                \KERROR LHS MODE="D" CNO="N" APID="OE"
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""
                                REPEAT
                        ENDIF
                        CALL ADD'WOE
                LOOP
        ENDIF
        CALL ROUND'WOE
        CALL ADD'DST
        CALL ADD'AGE
        UPDATE DOC FROM DOC'REC
        BAT'TRY'POST = SPACE
        UPDATE BAT SAV'BAT'RCN FROM BAT'REC
!!      IF HHS2'REC # HHS'REC THEN
!!              UPDATE HHS FROM HHS'REC
!!      ENDIF
        IF OLD'DOC'RCN # 0 THEN
                CALL CHECK'OLD'DOC
        ENDIF
        CALL CLEAN'UP
END

ABORT:                          !!Used for abnormal exit of program
                                !!such as error conditions or user
                                !!voluntary exit.
        ENTRY = "PROGRAM ABORTED BY "+UB'UID+" OR ABNORMAL ERROR CONDITION"
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
        ENTRY = "ABORTED!!!!!"
        \HDRERR
        CALL SNDMON
        PRGNAM="ABORT"
        CALL CLEAN'UP
END

MAP1 WOE'OPEN,B,1                               !![15]

CLEAN'UP:
        I = HHS'RCN
        IF WOE'OPEN = 1 THEN                    !![15]
                UNLOCK WOE
                WOE'RCN = 0 : REL WOE
        ENDIF
        LHS'RCN = 0 : REL LHS
        BAT'RCN = 0 : REL BAT
        DOC'RCN = 0 : REL DOC
        DST'RCN = 0 : REL DST
        AGE'RCN = 0 : REL AGE
        BSC'RCN = 0 : REL BSC                   !![51]
        IF PRGNAM # "ABORT" THEN PRGNAM = "GOOD"
        HDR'REC = HHS'REC                       !!NEW
        IF PRGNAM="GOOD" AND CTC > 0 AND CTC <= 200 THEN
                PRGNAM="CTRLC"
        ENDIF
        \LNKOUT
RETURN

COPY    "FORMAT"
COPY    "BASERR"
!!!COPY "SETBAT",OEPDOC="Y"

ADD'AGE:
        CALL RECOMPUTE'AGING
        DOC'AGE'TTL = DOC'AMT                           !Sum Of Aging Records
RETURN

COPY    "AGING[SR]",OEPOST="Y",APID="AR"                !!RECOMPUTE'AGING:

PRE'UPDATE2:
        UPDATE DOC FROM DOC'REC
RETURN

MAP1 WOE,F                              !![15]

ADD'DST:
        TWOE'TOTALS = SPACE
        DOC'DST'COUNT = 0
        IF MEM'WOE'CNT > 50 THEN
                WOE'KPLN'NO = 0
                WOE'KLIN'NO = 0
                USE WOE INTO WOE'REC KEY WOE'KEY
                GETNXT WOE INTO WOE'REC
                LAST'PLN'NO = WOE'PLN'NO
                LAST'STX'NO = WOE'STX'NO
                LAST'CMG'NO = WOE'CMG'NO
                DO UNTIL WOE'CTL # 0
                    CALL PROC'WOE                   !![15]
                    GETNXT WOE INTO WOE'REC
                LOOP
        ELSE
                                                        !![15] - below
                WOE'REC = MEM'WOE'REC(1)
                LAST'PLN'NO = WOE'PLN'NO
                LAST'STX'NO = WOE'STX'NO
                LAST'CMG'NO = WOE'CMG'NO
                CALL PROC'WOE
                IF MEM'WOE'CNT > 1 THEN                 !![16]
                    FOR WOE = 2 TO MEM'WOE'CNT
                        WOE'REC = MEM'WOE'REC(WOE)
                        CALL PROC'WOE
                    NEXT WOE
                ENDIF                                   !![16]
        ENDIF
        CALL BUILD'DST'RECORDS
RETURN

MAP1 SAV'CMG'NO,B,3

PROC'WOE:
        IF WOE'PLN'NO # LAST'PLN'NO     OR      &
           WOE'CMG'NO # LAST'CMG'NO     OR      &
           WOE'STX'NO # LAST'STX'NO CALL BUILD'DST'RECORDS
        SAV'CMG'NO = WOE'CMG'NO
        TTOTAL = TTOTAL + WOE'SHP'TOTAL
        TDISC = TDISC + WOE'SHP'DISC
        TSTX1FINAL = TSTX1FINAL + WOE'SHP'STX1
        TSTX2FINAL = TSTX2FINAL + WOE'SHP'STX2
        IF PRH'TAXABLE = "Y" THEN
                TSTX1'TAXABLE = TSTX1'TAXABLE + WOE'SHP'STX1
        ENDIF
        IF OEC'PPRGNAM="OEPACK" THEN
                FOR I = 1 TO 6
                        TCD(I) = TCD(I) + WOE'CD(I)
                NEXT I
                TVIA'SUM(1) = TVIA'SUM(1) + WOE'VIA'SUM(1)
                TVIA'SUM(2) = TVIA'SUM(2) + WOE'VIA'SUM(2)
        ELSE
                FOR I = 1 TO 7
                        TTBL'AMT(I) = TTBL'AMT(I) + WOE'SHP'VTTL(I)
                NEXT I
                TODISC = TODISC + WOE'SHP'ODISC
                TRETRO = TRETRO + WOE'SHP'RETRO
        ENDIF
RETURN

MAP1 NEW'APA'NO,B,2                             !![32]

BUILD'DST'RECORDS:
        IF LAST'PLN'NO # APA'PLN'NO OR HHS'GL'CNO # APA'GL'CNO THEN
                APA'KPLN'NO = LAST'PLN'NO
                APA'KGL'CNO = HHS'GL'CNO
                USE APA INTO APA'REC KEY APA'KEY
        ENDIF
        IF APA'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "Invalid G/L PLN: "+" HDR="+LOC'NO+"-"+HHS'DOC'TYPE+"-"+HHS'NO+"-"+WOE'LIN'NO+"/"+APA'KPLN'NO+"-"+APA'KGL'CNO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                CALL DO'ERRL
!!IF NOT FOUND USE FIRST LEGIT APA NUMBER
                APA'KPLN'NO = 0
                USE APA INTO APA'REC KEY APA'KEY
                GETNXT APA INTO APA'REC
                DO UNTIL APA'CTL # 0 OR APA'GL'CNO = HHS'GL'CNO
                        GETNXT APA INTO APA'REC
                LOOP
                IF APA'CTL # 0 THEN
                        ENTRY = "G/L distribution posting aborted "+V''JOBNAM[1,4]+" USER "+UB'UID+" PROGRAM "+PRGNAM
                        CALL DO'ERRL
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                        GOTO BUILD'DST'DONE
                ELSE
                        ENTRY = "USED PLN: "+APA'PLN'NO+"/"+APA'GL'CNO
                        CALL DO'ERRL
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
        IF HHS'PROC < 1 OR HHS'PROC > 4 THEN HHS'PROC = 1
        CALL CONVERT'APA

        AMT = TTOTAL                            !Sales
        CAT'NO = CAT'NO(HHS'PROC,1)             !Sales Cat
        NEW'APA'NO = APA'NO(HHS'PROC)           !![32]
        CALL SET'APA'NO                         !![32]
        ACT = SALES'ACT(HHS'PROC,1)             !Sales account
        IF PTC'BY'LOC(HHS'PROC,1) = "Y" THEN
                IF LOC'PTC # "" THEN
                        PTC = LOC'PTC
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
        IF CST'BY'LOC(HHS'PROC,1) = "Y" THEN
                IF LOC'CST # "" THEN
                        CST = LOC'CST
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
        CALL ADD'TO'DST

        FOR I = 1 TO 7
                CAT'NO = CAT'NO(HHS'PROC,2)     !Disc Cat
                IF OEC'PPRGNAM="OEPACK" THEN
                        IF I <= 6 THEN
                                AMT = TCD(I)
                                CAT'NO = OC2'CAT'NO(I)
                        ELSE
                                AMT = -TDISCS(1)
                        ENDIF
                ELSE
                        IF I > 3 THEN
                                I = 99
                                GOTO NXT'I
                        ENDIF
                        AMT = -TDISCS(I)                !Discounts
                        IF I = 2 AND OC2'CAT'NO(1) # 0 THEN
                                CAT'NO = OC2'CAT'NO(1)
                        ENDIF
                        IF I = 3 AND OC2'CAT'NO(2) # 0 THEN
                                CAT'NO = OC2'CAT'NO(2)
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF

                NEW'APA'NO = APA'NO(HHS'PROC)           !![32]
                CALL SET'APA'NO                         !![32]
                ACT = SALES'ACT(HHS'PROC,2)     !Disc account
                IF PTC'BY'LOC(HHS'PROC,2) = "Y" THEN
                        IF LOC'PTC # "" THEN
                                PTC = LOC'PTC
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
                IF CST'BY'LOC(HHS'PROC,2) = "Y" THEN
                        IF LOC'CST # "" THEN
                                CST = LOC'CST
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
                IF OEC'PPRGNAM="OEPACK" THEN
                        IF I <= 6 THEN
                          IF OC2'MACT(I) # 0 THEN
                                ACT = OC2'ACT(I)
                                IF LOC'PTC # "" THEN
                                        IF OC2'LOC'P(I) = "Y" THEN PTC = LOC'PTC
                                ENDIF
                                IF LOC'CST # "" THEN
                                        IF OC2'LOC'C(I) = "Y" THEN CST = LOC'CST
                                ENDIF
                          ENDIF
                        ENDIF
                ELSE
                        IF I = 2 AND OC2'MACT(1) # 0 THEN
                                ACT = OC2'ACT(1)
                                IF LOC'PTC # "" THEN
                                        IF OC2'LOC'P(1) = "Y" THEN PTC = LOC'PTC
                                ENDIF
                                IF LOC'CST # "" THEN
                                        IF OC2'LOC'C(1) = "Y" THEN CST = LOC'CST
                                ENDIF
                        ENDIF
                        IF I = 3 AND OC2'MACT(2) # 0 THEN
                                ACT = OC2'ACT(2)
                                IF LOC'PTC # "" THEN
                                        IF OC2'LOC'P(2) = "Y" THEN PTC = LOC'PTC
                                ENDIF
                                IF LOC'CST # "" THEN
                                        IF OC2'LOC'C(2) = "Y" THEN CST = LOC'CST
                                ENDIF
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
                CALL ADD'TO'DST
          NXT'I:
        NEXT I
        SAV'CMG'NO = WOE'CMG'NO
        WOE'CMG'NO = 0                  !!Clear This!!!!
                                        !!Unless you want it to look like
                                        !!Tax and freight are getting comm.
                                        !!NOTE: What's on the DST records
                                        !!Really doesn't do any thing to
                                        !!Commissions.  See ARCOM1 for
                                        !!more info.
CIF COMMENTS AND NOT COMMENTS THEN
        Commission groups are put only on DST records that are comissionable,
        not tax and freight, etc.  The DOC record MUST not have a CMG'NO
        because this will cause those DST records that have no CMG'NO
        to use the one on DOC.
ENDCIF

        FOR I = 1 TO 2
                AMT = TSTX(I)
                IF AMT # 0 THEN
                        CGL'KTYPE = 1           !TAX
                        IF I = 1 THEN
                                CGL'KMAIN'NO = CUS'STX'NO
                                        !![65] - if none, use control rec
                                IF CGL'KMAIN'NO = 0 THEN
                                        CGL'KMAIN'NO = ARC'STX'NO
                                ENDIF
                        ELSE
!!Wrong                         CGL'KMAIN'NO = WOE'STX'NO
                                CGL'KMAIN'NO = LAST'STX'NO

                        ENDIF
                        CGL'KGL'CNO = HHS'GL'CNO
                        IF STX'BY'PLN'YN = "Y" THEN
!![39]                          CGL'KPLN'NO = WOE'PLN'NO
                                CGL'KPLN'NO = APA'PLN'NO        !![39]
                        ELSE
                                CGL'KPLN'NO = 0
                        ENDIF
                        CALL GET'CGL
                        IF CGL'CTL # 0 THEN
                                ENTRY = "INVALID G/L on STX/PLN "+CGL'KMAIN'NO+"/"+CGL'KPLN'NO+" ("+STX'BY'PLN'YN+"):"
                                \LINERR PRE="LHS" APID="OE"
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                                MACT = 9999
                                PTC = 9999
                                CST = 9999
                                CAT'NO = 9999
                                APA'NO = 9999
                        ELSE
                                ACT = CGL'ACT
                                CAT'NO = CGL'CAT'NO
                                NEW'APA'NO = CGL'AR'APA'NO              !![32]
                                CALL SET'APA'NO                         !![32]
                        ENDIF
                        IF CGL'PTC'BY'LOC = "Y" THEN
                                IF LOC'PTC # "" THEN
                                        PTC = LOC'PTC
                                ENDIF
                        ENDIF
                        IF CGL'CST'BY'LOC = "Y" THEN
                                IF LOC'CST # "" THEN
                                        CST = LOC'CST
                                ENDIF
                        ENDIF
                        CALL ADD'TO'DST
                ENDIF
        NEXT I

        IF OEC'PPRGNAM="OEPACK" THEN
          MAP1 QQQ,F
          FOR I = 1 TO 2
            IF TVIA'SUM(I) # 0 THEN
                CGL'KTYPE = 2           !FREIGHT
                CGL'KMAIN'NO = 0
                CGL'KGL'CNO = HHS'GL'CNO
                FOR QQQ = 7 TO 1 STEP -1
                        IF I = 1 THEN
                                IF BOX'ORDER(QQQ) = "O" THEN
                                        CGL'KMAIN'NO = VIA'TBL'NO(QQQ)
                                ENDIF
                        ELSE
                                IF BOX'ORDER(QQQ) = "B" THEN
                                        CGL'KMAIN'NO = VIA'TBL'NO(QQQ)
                                ENDIF
                        ENDIF
                        IF BY'PLN(QQQ) = "Y" THEN
                                CGL'KPLN'NO = APA'PLN'NO
                        ELSE
                                CGL'KPLN'NO = 0
                        ENDIF
                        IF (CGL'KMAIN'NO > 0) THEN
                            QQQ = 0
                        ENDIF
                NEXT QQQ
                IF CGL'KMAIN'NO = 0 THEN
!!Should never happen
                        CGL'KMAIN'NO = VIA'TBL'NO(1)
                        IF BY'PLN(1) = "Y" THEN
                                CGL'KPLN'NO = APA'PLN'NO
                        ELSE
                                CGL'KPLN'NO = 0
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
                AMT = TVIA'SUM(I)
                CALL GET'CGL

                IF CGL'CTL # 0 THEN
                        ENTRY = "INVALID G/L on TBL/PLN "+CGL'KMAIN'NO+"/"+CGL'KPLN'NO+"/"+BY'PLN(I)+" HDR="+LOC'NO+"-"+HHS'DOC'TYPE+"-"+HHS'NO+"-"+WOE'LIN'NO
                        CALL DO'ERRL
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                        MACT = 9999
                        PTC = 9999
                        CST = 9999
                        CAT'NO = 9999
                        APA'NO = 9999
                ENDIF
                ACT = CGL'ACT
                CAT'NO = CGL'CAT'NO
                NEW'APA'NO = CGL'AR'APA'NO
                CALL SET'APA'NO
                IF CGL'PTC'BY'LOC = "Y" THEN
                        IF LOC'PTC # "" THEN
                                PTC = LOC'PTC
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
                IF CGL'CST'BY'LOC = "Y" THEN
                        IF LOC'CST # "" THEN
                                CST = LOC'CST
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
                CALL ADD'TO'DST
            ENDIF
          NEXT I
        ELSE
          FOR I = 1 TO 7
                AMT = TTBL'AMT(I)
                IF AMT # 0 THEN
                        IF I <= INC'MAX'VIA THEN
                                CGL'KTYPE = 2           !FREIGHT
                                CGL'KMAIN'NO = VIA'TBL'NO(I)
                                CGL'KGL'CNO = HHS'GL'CNO
                                IF BY'PLN(I) = "Y" THEN
!![39]                                  CGL'KPLN'NO = WOE'PLN'NO
                                        CGL'KPLN'NO = APA'PLN'NO        !![39]
                                ELSE
                                        CGL'KPLN'NO = 0
                                ENDIF
                                CALL GET'CGL
                        ELSE
                                CGL'CTL = 0
                        ENDIF
                        CASE
                        IF CGL'CTL # 0 THEN
                                ENTRY = "INVALID G/L on TBL/PLN "+CGL'KMAIN'NO+"/"+CGL'KPLN'NO+"/"+BY'PLN(I)+" HDR="+LOC'NO+"-"+HHS'DOC'TYPE+"-"+HHS'NO+"-"+WOE'LIN'NO
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                                MACT = 9999
                                PTC = 9999
                                CST = 9999
                                CAT'NO = 9999
                                APA'NO = 9999
                        ELSE
                        IF I > INC'MAX'VIA THEN
                                IF OC2'MACT(I-INC'MAX'VIA+2) # 0 THEN
!!From Control record
                                        ACT = OC2'ACT(I-INC'MAX'VIA+2)
                                        IF LOC'PTC # "" THEN
                                                IF OC2'LOC'P(I-INC'MAX'VIA+2) = "Y" THEN PTC = LOC'PTC
                                        ENDIF
                                        IF LOC'CST # "" THEN
                                                IF OC2'LOC'C(I-INC'MAX'VIA+2) = "Y" THEN CST = LOC'CST
                                        ENDIF
                                ELSE
!!Discount account
                                        ACT = SALES'ACT(HHS'PROC,2)
                                        IF PTC'BY'LOC(HHS'PROC,2) = "Y" THEN
                                                IF LOC'PTC # "" THEN
                                                        PTC = LOC'PTC
                                                ENDIF
                                        ENDIF
                                        IF CST'BY'LOC(HHS'PROC,2) = "Y" THEN
                                                IF LOC'CST # "" THEN
                                                        CST = LOC'CST
                                                ENDIF
                                        ENDIF
                                ENDIF
                                IF OC2'CAT'NO(I-INC'MAX'VIA+2) # 0 THEN
                                        CAT'NO = OC2'CAT'NO(I-INC'MAX'VIA+2)
                                ELSE
                                        CAT'NO = CAT'NO(HHS'PROC,2)     !Disc Cat
                                ENDIF
                                NEW'APA'NO = APA'NO(HHS'PROC)           !![32]
                                CALL SET'APA'NO                         !![32]
                        ELSE
                                ACT = CGL'ACT
                                CAT'NO = CGL'CAT'NO
                                NEW'APA'NO = CGL'AR'APA'NO              !![32]
                                CALL SET'APA'NO                         !![32]
                                IF CGL'PTC'BY'LOC = "Y" THEN
                                        IF LOC'PTC # "" THEN
                                                PTC = LOC'PTC
                                        ENDIF
                                ENDIF
                                IF CGL'CST'BY'LOC = "Y" THEN
                                        IF LOC'CST # "" THEN
                                                CST = LOC'CST
                                        ENDIF
                                ENDIF
                        ENDCASE
                        CALL ADD'TO'DST
                ENDIF
           NEXT I
        ENDIF
BUILD'DST'DONE:
        WOE'CMG'NO = SAV'CMG'NO
        TWOE'TOTALS = SPACE
        LAST'PLN'NO = WOE'PLN'NO
        LAST'STX'NO = WOE'STX'NO
        LAST'CMG'NO = WOE'CMG'NO
RETURN

MAP1 MEM'DST                                    !![7]
        MAP2 MEM'APA'NO(50),B,2
        MAP2 MEM'CAT'NO(50),B,2
        MAP2 MEM'CMG'NO(50),B,3
        MAP2 MEM'ACT(50)
                MAP3 MEM'MACT,B,2
                MAP3 MEM'PTC,B,2
                MAP3 MEM'CST,B,2
        MAP2 MEM'DST'RCN(50),B,4
        MAP2 MEM'CNT,B,1

ADD'TO'DST:
        IF AMT = 0 THEN
!!Invalid Distribution?
            ENTRY  = "ADD'TO'DST: AMT=0 RETURN. TRK'NO="+PRH'KTRK'NO+" LHS'KEY="
            \KERROR LHS MODE="D" CNO="N" APID="OE"
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""
            RETURN                                       !!KLUDGE
        ENDIF
!![32]  IF CUS'APA'NO # 0 THEN
!!              APA'NO = CUS'APA'NO
!![32]  ENDIF
        IF ARC'MULTI'APA = "N" THEN
                APA'NO = 1
        ENDIF
!![7]   LAST'SEQ = 0
        CASE
        IF MEM'CNT = 0 THEN                                     !![7]
                CALL NEW'DST
        ELSE
        IF MEM'CNT <= 50 THEN                                   !![7]
                DST'RCN = 0
                FOR II = 1 TO MEM'CNT
                        IF APA'NO = MEM'APA'NO(II)              AND &
                           CAT'NO = MEM'CAT'NO(II)              AND &
                           WOE'CMG'NO = MEM'CMG'NO(II)          AND &
                           ACT = MEM'ACT(II)                    THEN
                                DST'RCN = MEM'DST'RCN(II)
                                II = MEM'CNT + 1
                        ENDIF
                NEXT II
                IF DST'RCN = 0 THEN
                        CALL NEW'DST
                ELSE
                        CALL UPDATE'DST
                ENDIF
        ELSE
                DST'KDOC'NO = DOC'ORG'NO
                DST'KSEQ = 0
                USE DST INTO DST'REC KEY DST'KEY
                DO
                        GETNXT DST INTO DST'REC
                        CASE
                        IF DST'CTL # 0 OR DST'DOC'NO # DOC'ORG'NO THEN
                                CALL NEW'DST
                                EXIT
                        ELSE
                        IF DST'CAT'NO = CAT'NO AND DST'ACT = ACT                AND &
                                  DST'APA'NO = APA'NO AND DST'CMG'NO = WOE'CMG'NO THEN
                                CALL UPDATE'DST
                                EXIT
                        ENDCASE
!![7]                   LAST'SEQ = DST'SEQ
                LOOP
        ENDCASE
RETURN

UPDATE'DST:
        RDLOCK DST
        DST'AMT = DST'AMT + AMT
        WRITE DST
RETURN

NEW'DST:
        DST'SPACE = SPACE
        DST'DOC'NO = DOC'ORG'NO
!![7]   DST'SEQ = LAST'SEQ + 5
        DST'SEQ = (MEM'CNT+1)*5                                 !![7]
        DST'AMT = AMT
        DST'CAT'NO = CAT'NO
        DST'APA'NO = APA'NO
        DST'GL'CNO = APA'GL'CNO
        DST'ACT = ACT
        DST'CMG'NO = WOE'CMG'NO
        \SETKEY PRE="DST" MODE="KEY" APP="AR"
        USE DST INTO DST'REC KEY DST'KEY
!!Invalid Distribution log
        IF DST'CTL = 0 THEN                !!WHY DOES IT EXIST?
            ENTRY = "OEPDOC: Already exists?  DST'AMT="+DST'AMT+ &
                " DOC'ORG'NO="+(DOC'ORG'NO USING "############")+" DST'KEY="
            \KERROR DST MODE="D" CNO="N" APID="AR"
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""
        ENDIF

        ADD DST FROM DST'REC KEY DST'KEY
        IF DST'CTL = 0 THEN
                \SETKEY PRE="DST" MODE="KY2" APP="AR"
                \ADDKEY PRE="DST" MODE="KY2" APP="AR"
                DOC'DST'COUNT = DOC'DST'COUNT + 1
!!Invalid Distribution log
                IF DST'AMT = 0 OR DST'MACT = 0 THEN
                    ENTRY = "OEPDOC: DST'AMT="+DST'AMT+" DST'MACT="+DST'MACT+ &
                    " DOC'ORG'NO="+(DOC'ORG'NO USING "############")+" DST'KEY="
                    \KERROR DST MODE="D" CNO="N" APID="AR"
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""
                ENDIF
        ELSE
                ENTRY = "Bad DST add:"
                \KERROR DST APID="AR"
                ENTRY = "Bad DST add: DOC'NO "+DST'DOC'NO+" SEQ "+DST'SEQ+" AMT "+DST'AMT+&
                    " CAT'NO "+DST'CAT'NO+" APA NO "+DST'APA'NO+" GL'CNO "+DST'GL'CNO+&
                        " ACT "+DST'ACT+" CMG'NO "+DST'CMG'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
!!Invalid Distribution log
                IF DST'AMT = 0 OR DST'MACT THEN
                    ENTRY = "OEPDOC: Bad DST add: DST'AMT="+DST'AMT+" DST'KEY="
                    \KERROR DST MODE="D" CNO="N" APID="AR"
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""
                ENDIF
                GOTO DO'ERRL                            !!KLUDGE [7]
        ENDIF
!![7] - below
        MEM'CNT = MEM'CNT + 1
        IF MEM'CNT <= 50 THEN
                MEM'APA'NO(MEM'CNT) = DST'APA'NO
                MEM'CAT'NO(MEM'CNT) = DST'CAT'NO
                MEM'CMG'NO(MEM'CNT) = DST'CMG'NO
                MEM'ACT(MEM'CNT) = DST'ACT
                MEM'DST'RCN(MEM'CNT) = DST'RCN
        ENDIF
RETURN

SET'APA'NO:                                     !![32] - made subroutine.
!!Note: three APA number OVERRIDES with precedence in order
!!      1) Terms, 2) Customer, 3) Location
!!      If no override, then it is set from wherever (product line or
!!              CGL or other source.
        CASE
        IF TRH'APA'NO # 0 THEN
                APA'NO = TRH'APA'NO             !![22] - add this case
        ELSE
        IF CUS'APA'NO # 0 THEN                  !![32]
                APA'NO = CUS'APA'NO             !![32]
        ELSE                                    !![32]
        IF LOC'AR'APA'NO(HHS'DOC'TYPE) # 0 THEN
                APA'NO = LOC'AR'APA'NO(HHS'DOC'TYPE)
        ELSE
                APA'NO = NEW'APA'NO             !![32]
        ENDCASE
RETURN
        TWOE'TOTALS = SPACE

MAP1 MEM'WOE
        MAP2 MEM'WOE'REC(51),X,102
        MAP2 MEM'WOE'CNT,B,2

MAP1 SHPFACTOR,F
MAP1 LWOE'RCN,B,4
MAP1 LWOE'II,B,1

ADD'WOE:
!!STX1 contains taxable amount at this point ...
!!     factor in order discount throughout
        WOE'SPACE = SPACE
        WOE'LIN'NO = LHS'NO
        WOE'PLN'NO = PRH'PLN'NO
        WOE'TRK'NO = PRH'TRK'NO                 !![20]

        QFACTOR = 10^LHS'QFRACTION
        PFACTOR = 10^LHS'PFRACTION
        IF (HHS'SHP'TOTAL-HHS'SHP'DISC) # 0 AND OEC'PPRGNAM # "OEPACK" THEN
                DFACTOR = 1 - (HHS'SHP'ODISC+HHS'SHP'RETRO)/(HHS'SHP'TOTAL-HHS'SHP'DISC)
        ELSE
                DFACTOR = 1
        ENDIF

!![40] - replaced all net computations by macro.
                                !!COMPUTE'NETS:
        \COMNET NET'PRICE="WOE'SHP'TOTAL" NET'DISC="WOE'SHP'DISC"

MAP1 MOD'BASE,B,5

        IF PRH'QTD'COUNT # 0 THEN
            MOD'BASE = WOE'SHP'TOTAL
            \FROUND MOD'BASE/10 WOE'SHP'TOTAL
        ENDIF

        WORK'NET = WOE'SHP'TOTAL - WOE'SHP'DISC

!!BFACTOR IS FRACTION OF INVOICE CHARGES THAT GO TO THIS WOE RECORD
!!                      (E.G. THIS LINE ITEM)
!!
        IF (HHS'SHP'TOTAL-HHS'SHP'DISC) # 0 THEN
            BFACTOR = WORK'NET / (HHS'SHP'TOTAL-HHS'SHP'DISC)
!!SHPFACTOR is percentage of freight per WOE (and if no CCAMT same as BFACTOR)
            IF CCAMT = 0 THEN
                SHPFACTOR = BFACTOR
            ELSE
                IF LHS'TRK'NO = OC2'TRK'NO THEN
                    SHPFACTOR = 0
                ELSE
!!Computed amount based on total less CCAMT
                    SHPFACTOR = WORK'NET / (HHS'SHP'TOTAL-HHS'SHP'DISC-CCAMT)
                ENDIF
            ENDIF
        ELSE
            BFACTOR = 1
            SHPFACTOR = 1
        ENDIF
        CASE
        IF PRH'TAXABLE = "Y" AND TAX'PERC # 0 THEN
                IF OEC'UK'VAT'YN # "Y" THEN
                        \FROUND (DFACTOR*WORK'NET*TAX'PERC)/10000 WOE'SHP'STX1
                ELSE
                                CIF COMMENTS AND NOT COMMENTS THEN
                                        IGNORE DECIMALS AND USE BELOW
                                                EXAMPLE:
                                        WORK'NET = 100.00 (LINE ITEM NET)
                                        TAX'PERC = 10.00
                                        TRH'MPERC = 5.00
                                        DFACTOR = 1 (NO ORDER DISCOUNT)
                                ENDCIF
                        \FROUND DFACTOR*WORK'NET*TAX'PERC/10000 II
!!                              II = 10.00
                        \FROUND II+((DFACTOR*WORK'NET)*(1-(TRH'MPERC/10000))) II
!!                              II = 10.00 + ((100.00 X .95) = 105.00
                        \FROUND II-(II/(1+(TAX'PERC/10000))) WOE'SHP'STX1
!!                              105.00-(105.00/(1.1) = 9.55 = REALLY THE TAX
                        \FROUND (DFACTOR*WORK'NET*TAX'PERC)/10000 II
!!                              100.00 * .1 = 10.00 = II
                        WOE'SHP'TOTAL = WOE'SHP'TOTAL - WOE'SHP'STX1 + II
!!                              SHP'TOTAL = 100.45, SHP'STX1 = 9.55
                ENDIF
        ELSE
        IF PRH'TAXABLE = "I" AND TAX'PERC # 0 THEN
!![6] - this case
                IF OEC'UK'VAT'YN # "Y" THEN
                        II = WOE'SHP'TOTAL
                        \FROUND WOE'SHP'TOTAL/(1+(TAX'PERC/10000)) WOE'SHP'TOTAL
                        \FROUND (II-WOE'SHP'TOTAL)*DFACTOR WOE'SHP'STX1
                ELSE
                                CIF COMMENTS AND NOT COMMENTS THEN
                                        110.00 = WORK'NET
                                         10.00% TAX'PERC
                                          5.00% TRH'MPERC
                                        NOTE:  same example as above!
                                               used 110.00 because tax
                                               included.
                                ENDCIF
                        QQ = WORK'NET
                        \FROUND WORK'NET/(1+(TAX'PERC/10000)) WORK'NET
                        II = QQ - WORK'NET              !![26]
                        \FROUND II+((DFACTOR*WORK'NET)*(1-(TRH'MPERC/10000))) II
                        \FROUND II-(II/(1+(TAX'PERC/10000))) WOE'SHP'STX1
                        II = QQ - WORK'NET              !![26]
                        WOE'SHP'TOTAL = WORK'NET - WOE'SHP'STX1 + II
                        WORK'NET = QQ                   !!Got it back


                ENDIF
                BS'STX1 = BS'STX1 + WOE'SHP'STX1
                BS'TOTAL = BS'TOTAL + WOE'SHP'TOTAL             !![8]
        ELSE
                WOE'SHP'STX1 = 0
        ENDCASE
        TSTX1FINAL = TSTX1FINAL + WOE'SHP'STX1
!![20] Below
        IF PRH'TAXABLE = "Y" THEN
                TSTX1'TAXABLE = TSTX1'TAXABLE + WOE'SHP'STX1
        ENDIF
!![20] Above

        IF PRH'STX'NO # 0 AND (CUS'TAXABLE = "Y" OR CUS'TAXABLE = "E") THEN
                STX2'KLOC'NO = LHS'LOC'NO
                STX2'KNO = PRH'STX'NO
                CALL GET'STX2
                IF STX2'CTL # 0 THEN
                    ENTRY = "Warning:  part tax bad:  HDR="+LOC'NO+"-"+HHS'DOC'TYPE+"-"+HHS'NO+"-"+LHS'NO
                    CALL DO'ERRL
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                    TTL'STX2'PERC = 0
                ELSE
                    TSTSTX = "E"
                    CALL COMPUTE'TTL'STX2'PERC
                ENDIF
                \FROUND WORK'NET*TTL'STX2'PERC/10000 WOE'SHP'STX2
                WOE'STX'NO = STX2'NO
        ELSE
                WOE'SHP'STX2 = 0
        ENDIF
        TSTX2FINAL = TSTX2FINAL + WOE'SHP'STX2

        IF OEC'PPRGNAM="OEPACK" THEN
                FOR II = 1 TO 6
                        \FROUND (HHS'CD(II)*SHPFACTOR) WOE'CD(II)
                        TCD(II) = TCD(II) + WOE'CD(II)
                NEXT II
                \FROUND HHS'VIA'SUM(1)*SHPFACTOR WOE'VIA'SUM(1)
                TVIA'SUM(1) = TVIA'SUM(1) + WOE'VIA'SUM(1)
                \FROUND HHS'VIA'SUM(2)*SHPFACTOR WOE'VIA'SUM(2)
                TVIA'SUM(2) = TVIA'SUM(2) + WOE'VIA'SUM(2)
        ELSE
                FOR II = 1 TO 7
                        \FROUND (HHS'SHP'VTTL(II)*SHPFACTOR) WOE'SHP'VTTL(II)
                        TTBL'AMT(II) = TTBL'AMT(II) + WOE'SHP'VTTL(II)
                NEXT II
                \FROUND HHS'SHP'ODISC*SHPFACTOR WOE'SHP'ODISC
                TODISC = TODISC + WOE'SHP'ODISC
                \FROUND HHS'SHP'RETRO*SHPFACTOR WOE'SHP'RETRO
                TRETRO = TRETRO + WOE'SHP'RETRO
        ENDIF

        \FROUND HHS'OLD'CR*BFACTOR WOE'OLD'CR
        TOLD'CR = TOLD'CR + WOE'OLD'CR

        \FROUND HHS'OLD'DR*BFACTOR WOE'OLD'DR
        TOLD'DR = TOLD'DR + WOE'OLD'DR

        \FROUND HHS'OLD'CASH*BFACTOR WOE'OLD'CASH
        TOLD'CASH = TOLD'CASH + WOE'OLD'CASH

        WOE'PLN'NO = PRH'PLN'NO
        IF INC'INTERFACE = 5 THEN
            WOE'CMG'NO = HHS'CMG'NO
        ELSE
            WOE'CMG'NO = LHS'CMG'NO
        ENDIF
        TWOE'COUNT = TWOE'COUNT + 1

        IF MEM'WOE'CNT <= 50 THEN                               !![15]
                MEM'WOE'CNT = MEM'WOE'CNT + 1
                MEM'WOE'REC(MEM'WOE'CNT) = WOE'REC
                IF LHS'TRK'NO # OC2'TRK'NO THEN
                    LWOE'II = MEM'WOE'CNT
                    LWOE'RCN = 0
                ENDIF
                IF MEM'WOE'CNT = 51 THEN
                        DO
                                \CLRWOE
                                IF WOE'CTL # 0 THEN
                                        ENTRY = "All work files currently in use, please try again later"
                                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                                        CALL DO'ERRL
                                        IF IN'BGP # 0 GOTO ABORT
                                        \SLEEP 5
                                ENDIF
                        LOOP UNTIL WOE'CTL = 0
                        WOE'OPEN = 1
                        FOR WOE = 1 TO 51
                                WOE'REC = MEM'WOE'REC(WOE)
                                \SETKEY PRE="WOE" MODE="KEY"
                                ADD WOE FROM WOE'REC KEY WOE'KEY
                                IF WOE'CTL # 0 THEN
                                        ENTRY = "ERROR - MEM Unable to add work file record "+WOE'PLN'NO+" "+WOE'CMG'NO+" "+WOE'LIN'NO
                                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                                        CALL DO'ERRL            !!09/19/90 ESE  (add L not compiled)
                                ENDIF
                        NEXT WOE
                ENDIF
        ELSE
                \SETKEY PRE="WOE" MODE="KEY"
                ADD WOE FROM WOE'REC KEY WOE'KEY
!![9] Below
                IF WOE'CTL # 0 THEN
                        ENTRY = "ERROR - Unable to add work file record "+WOE'PLN'NO+" "+WOE'CMG'NO+" "+WOE'LIN'NO
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                        CALL DO'ERRL            !!09/19/90 ESE  (add L not compiled)
                ENDIF
                IF LHS'TRK'NO # OC2'TRK'NO THEN
                    LWOE'II = 0
                    LWOE'RCN = WOE'RCN
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
!![9] Above
RETURN

ROUND'WOE:
!!
!!This fixes round-off on last WOE for ship via charges charged by the
!!order and distributed over each box
!!
        IF TWOE'COUNT = 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "Cannot ship - no line items to ship: "+" HDR="+LOC'NO+"-"+HHS'DOC'TYPE+"-"+HHS'NO+"-"+HHS'SHIPMENT
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                CALL DO'ERRL
                RETURN
        ENDIF
        IF MEM'WOE'CNT > 50 THEN                        !![15]
                RDLOCK WOE
                IF WOE'CTL # 0 THEN
                        ENTRY = "ERROR - Unable to read work file record "+WOE'PLN'NO+" "+WOE'CMG'NO+" "+WOE'LIN'NO
                        CALL DO'ERR
                        RETURN
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
        SF = 0
        IF CCAMT # 0 AND (LWOE'II # 0 OR LWOE'RCN # 0) THEN
            IF MEM'WOE'CNT <= 50 AND MEM'WOE'CNT = LWOE'II  THEN SF = 1
            IF MEM'WOE'CNT > 50 AND WOE'RCN = LWOE'RCN THEN SF = 1
        ENDIF
        IF SF = 0 THEN
            IF OEC'PPRGNAM = "OEPACK" THEN
                FOR II = 1 TO 6
                    WOE'CD(II) = HHS'CD(II) -       &
                                        TCD(II) + WOE'CD(II)
                NEXT II
                WOE'VIA'SUM(1) = HHS'VIA'SUM(1) - TVIA'SUM(1) + WOE'VIA'SUM(1)
                WOE'VIA'SUM(2) = HHS'VIA'SUM(2) - TVIA'SUM(2) + WOE'VIA'SUM(2)
            ELSE
                FOR II = 1 TO 7
                    WOE'SHP'VTTL(II) = HHS'SHP'VTTL(II) -   &
                                        TTBL'AMT(II) + WOE'SHP'VTTL(II)
                NEXT II
                WOE'SHP'ODISC = HHS'SHP'ODISC - TODISC + WOE'SHP'ODISC
                WOE'SHP'RETRO = HHS'SHP'RETRO - TRETRO + WOE'SHP'RETRO
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
!![6] - below added BS'STX1
        IF OEC'UK'VAT'YN = "Y" THEN
!![8]           WORK'NET = HHS'SHP'TOTAL-HHS'SHP'DISC
!![8] Below
                WORK'NET = HHS'SHP'TOTAL-HHS'SHP'DISC - BS'STX1 - BS'TOTAL
!![8] Above
                \FROUND DFACTOR*WORK'NET*TAX'PERC/10000 II
                \FROUND II+((DFACTOR*WORK'NET)*(1-(TRH'MPERC/10000))) II
                \FROUND II-(II/(1+(TAX'PERC/10000))) II
                II = HHS'STX1FINAL - II         !![8]
!![8]           II = (HHS'STX1FINAL - II) - (TSTX1FINAL - BS'STX1)
!!
                WOE'SHP'STX1 = WOE'SHP'STX1 + II
                TSTX1'TAXABLE = TSTX1'TAXABLE + II              !![20]
                WOE'SHP'STX1 = HHS'STX1FINAL - TSTX1'TAXABLE + WOE'SHP'STX1 !![20]
                WOE'SHP'TOTAL = WOE'SHP'TOTAL - II
        ELSE
                WOE'SHP'STX1 = HHS'STX1FINAL - (TSTX1FINAL - BS'STX1) + WOE'SHP'STX1
        ENDIF
        WOE'SHP'STX2 = HHS'STX2FINAL - TSTX2FINAL + WOE'SHP'STX2
        WOE'OLD'CR = HHS'OLD'CR - TOLD'CR + WOE'OLD'CR
        WOE'OLD'DR = HHS'OLD'DR - TOLD'DR + WOE'OLD'DR
        WOE'OLD'CASH = HHS'OLD'CASH - TOLD'CASH + WOE'OLD'CASH
        IF MEM'WOE'CNT > 50 THEN                        !![15]
            WRITE WOE
        ELSE
            MEM'WOE'REC(MEM'WOE'CNT) = WOE'REC
        ENDIF
        SF = 0
        IF CCAMT # 0 AND (LWOE'II # 0 OR LWOE'RCN # 0) THEN
            IF MEM'WOE'CNT <= 50 AND MEM'WOE'CNT = LWOE'II THEN SF = 1
            IF MEM'WOE'CNT > 50 AND WOE'RCN = LWOE'RCN THEN SF = 1
        ENDIF
        IF SF # 0 THEN
            IF LWOE'II # 0 THEN
                WOE'REC = MEM'WOE'REC(LWOE'II)
            ELSE
                RDLOCK WOE LWOE'RCN INTO WOE'REC
            ENDIF
            IF OEC'PPRGNAM = "OEPACK" THEN
                FOR II = 1 TO 6
                    WOE'CD(II) = HHS'CD(II) -       &
                                        TCD(II) + WOE'CD(II)
                NEXT II
                WOE'VIA'SUM(1) = HHS'VIA'SUM(1) - TVIA'SUM(1) + WOE'VIA'SUM(1)
                WOE'VIA'SUM(2) = HHS'VIA'SUM(2) - TVIA'SUM(2) + WOE'VIA'SUM(2)
            ELSE
                FOR II = 1 TO 7
                    WOE'SHP'VTTL(II) = HHS'SHP'VTTL(II) -   &
                                        TTBL'AMT(II) + WOE'SHP'VTTL(II)
                NEXT II
                WOE'SHP'ODISC = HHS'SHP'ODISC - TODISC + WOE'SHP'ODISC
                WOE'SHP'RETRO = HHS'SHP'RETRO - TRETRO + WOE'SHP'RETRO
            ENDIF
            IF LWOE'II # 0 THEN
                MEM'WOE'REC(LWOE'II) = WOE'REC
            ELSE
                WRITE WOE FROM WOE'REC
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
RETURN

GET'CGL:                !![38] - test PLN'NO below.
        IF CGL'KTYPE # CGL'TYPE OR CGL'KMAIN'NO # CGL'MAIN'NO   &
                                OR CGL'KGL'CNO # CGL'GL'CNO OR  &
                                  CGL'KPLN'NO # CGL'PLN'NO THEN
                USE CGL INTO CGL'REC KEY CGL'KEY
        ENDIF
RETURN

FIND'BAT'DOC:
!![12] - Below
!!      IF OEC'IDTTO # "Y" THEN
!!              DTT = DATE
!!      ELSE
!!              DTT = HHS'ORDER'DTT
!!      ENDIF
!![25] Below
        CASE
        IF ORG'DTT # 0 THEN
                DTT = ORG'DTT
        ELSE
!![25] Above
        IF OEC'IDTTO = "Y" THEN
                DTT = HHS'ORDER'DTT
        ELSE
        IF OEC'IDTTO = "P" THEN
                DTT = HHS'PROM'DTT
        ELSE
                DTT = DATE
        ENDCASE
!![12] - Above
        \READCTL APID="AR" GL="N"
!![25] Below
        IF ORG'BATCH # 0 THEN
                BAT'KTYPE = 1
                BAT'KYEAR = ORG'YEAR
                BAT'KBATCH = ORG'BATCH
                RDLOCK BAT INTO BAT'REC KEY BAT'KEY
                IF BAT'CTL = 0 THEN
                        IF BAT'PQU'STAT = "Q" CALL CHECK'PQU
                        IF BAT'STAT # "U" OR                             &
                        BAT'PERIOD # ORG'PERIOD OR                       &
                        BAT'PQU'STAT = "Q" OR                            &
                        (BAT'TRY'POST # "" AND BAT'TRY'POST # "OEPDOC")&
                                                                        THEN
                                REL BAT
                                BAT'CTL = 3  !!FAKE IT OUT TO GET NEW BATCH
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
        IF ORG'BATCH = 0 OR BAT'CTL # 0 THEN
!![25] Above
                MAP1 VOCC,B,1
                MAP1 VD,S,10
                MAP1 OE1WGA'TYP'APA,B,2

                XCALL GETENV,"OE1WGA_TYP_FORMAT",ENTRY
                I = INSTR(1,ENTRY,"_")
                IF I # 0 THEN
                    OE1WGA'TYP'APA = VAL(ENTRY[1,I-1])
                    IF TRH'APA'NO # OE1WGA'TYP'APA THEN
                        I = 0
                    ENDIF
                ENDIF
                IF I # 0 THEN
                    VOCC = 8
                    VD = "POS"
                ELSE
                    VOCC = 1
                    VD = "Invoice"
                ENDIF
                \BATBSC VDESC="VD" APID="AR" PRGNAM="OEPDOC"        &
                        DTT="DTT" SOURCE="OE" OCCUR="VOCC" BTYPE="1"       &
                        LAST'TRN="LAST'TRN" MODE="MOD'MODE" FIND'MODE="""A"""
        ENDIF                                                   !![25]
        SAV'BAT'RCN = BAT'RCN
        BAT'TRY'POST = "OEPDOC"
        UPDATE BAT
        CALL ADD'DOC
RETURN

!![25] Below
COPYF "WK4FIL[AR]"

CHECK'PQU:
        \CHKPQU PRGNAM="ARRELP" PASREC="WK4'REC"      &
                                       SF'TEST=CHECK'BATCHES
        IF SF = 1 THEN
                BAT'PQU'STAT = "N"
                UPDATE BAT FROM BAT'REC
        ENDIF
RETURN

CHECK'BATCHES:
        IF WK4'YEAR = BAT'YEAR AND                              &
           BAT'BATCH >= WK4'START'BCH AND                       &
           BAT'BATCH <= WK4'END'BCH AND                 &
                  ((WK4'PRINT'CODE = "P" AND BAT'STAT = "U")    &
                                        OR                              &
                   (WK4'PRINT'CODE = "G" AND BAT'STAT = "P")    &
                                        OR                              &
                   (WK4'PRINT'CODE = "R" AND BAT'STAT = "G")) THEN
                SF = 0
        ENDIF
RETURN
!![25] Above

COPYF "CMNFIL[SY]"
MAP1 CMN'EXTRA
        MAP2 XCR'INV'TYPE,B,1
        MAP2 XCR'INVOICE,B,3
        MAP2 XDR'INV'TYPE,B,1
        MAP2 XDR'INVOICE,B,3
        MAP2 XAPL'AMT,B,5
        MAP2 XAPL'DTT,B,3
        MAP2 XAPL'CUS'NO,B,3
        MAP2 APL'SOURCE,S,2
MAP1 FLAG,B,1


!!Add DOC record
ADD'DOC:
        CALL SET'DOC'FIELDS
        CALL ADD'DOC'RECORD
        !!We don't allow cash to drive positive invoice to a negative
        IF HHS'OLD'CASH > 0 AND DOC'AMT > 0 THEN
                HHS'OLD'CASH = HHS'OLD'CASH MIN DOC'AMT
        ENDIF
        IF OEC'CR'PO = "Y" AND DOC'AMT < 0 AND &
                        (HHS'PO[2;1] = "-" OR UCS(HHS'PO[-1,-1]) = "R") THEN
                CALL CREATE'CREDIT'APPLY'TOS
        ENDIF
        IF HHS'OLD'CASH # 0 THEN
                CALL CREATE'CASH'APPLICATIONS
        ENDIF
        !!Send FLiP alarm
        IF CUS'FLPALM'UID # "" THEN
                IF CUS'FLPALM'UID = "SELF" THEN CUS'FLPALM'UID = UB'UID
                DTT = DOC'ORG'DDTT
                CALL CNV'DTT
                YDAYS = YDAYS - (CUS'FLPALM MAX 1)
                CALL UCNV'DTT
                \STRDTT DTT="DOC'ORG'DDTT" DDATE="ENTRY"
                ENTRY = "Due from "+LST'COMPANY+" on "+ENTRY+" for "+((DOC'AMT/100) USING "$$###,###.##-")+" inv: "+STR(DOC'INV'TYPE)+"-"+STR(DOC'INVOICE)
                \FLPALM ENTRY TO="CUS'FLPALM'UID" FROM="UB'UID" &
                                        DATE="DTT" TIME="28800" RPT="2"
        ENDIF
RETURN

SET'DOC'FIELDS:
        DOC'SPACE = SPACE
        DOC'CUS'NO = HHS'NAM'NO                         !Customer Number
        IF OEC'IDTTO = "Y" THEN
                DOC'DTT = HHS'ORDER'DTT
        ELSE
        IF OEC'IDTTO = "P" THEN
                DOC'DTT = HHS'PROM'DTT
        ELSE
                DOC'DTT = HHS'PSTDT                             !![23]
        ENDIF
        ENDIF
        DOC'ORG'DTT = DOC'DTT                           !Date Of Original Document
        DOC'INV'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE                     !Invoice Type
        CALL SET'NEW'INTERNAL
        DOC'INVOICE = NEW'INTERNAL
        DOC'HDR'LOC'NO = HHS'LOC'NO                     !OE Location
        DOC'DOC'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE                     !OE Doc Type
        DOC'HDR'NO = HHS'NO                             !OE Order Number
        DOC'SHIPMENT = HHS'SHIPMENT                     !OE Shipment
        CASE
        IF HHS'PO # "" THEN
                DOC'PO = HHS'PO                                 !Purchase Order #
        ELSE
        IF OEC'PO'UKY # 0 THEN
                UKY'KKY = OEC'PO'UKY + 10
                UKY'KHDR'LOC'NO = HHS'LOC'NO
                UKY'KDOC'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
                UKY'KHDR'NO = HHS'NO
                UKY'KSHIPMENT = HHS'SHIPMENT
                USE UKY INTO UKY'REC KEY UKY'KEY
                IF UKY'CTL = 0 THEN
                        DOC'PO = UKY'NO
                ENDIF
        ENDCASE
        DOC'STAT = "U"                                  !Posting Status
        CALL DO'HDRSUM
        CASE
        IF HHS'PROC = 1 THEN
                DOC'GRP'NO = OEC'GRP'NO1(HHS'DOC'TYPE)  !Distribution Group Number
        ELSE
        IF HHS'PROC = 2 THEN
                DOC'GRP'NO = OEC'GRP'NO2(HHS'DOC'TYPE)  !Distribution Group Number
        ELSE
        IF HHS'PROC = 3 THEN
                DOC'GRP'NO = OEC'GRP'NO3(HHS'DOC'TYPE)  !Distribution Group Number
        ELSE
        IF HHS'PROC = 4 THEN
                DOC'GRP'NO = OEC'GRP'NO4(HHS'DOC'TYPE)  !Distribution Group Number
        ELSE
                DOC'GRP'NO = 9999       !!FIX LATER
        ENDCASE
        DOC'TRH'NO = HHS'TRH'NO                         !Payment Terms
        DOC'PRINT'YN = "N"                              !Print Deposit slip Y/N
        IF OEC'CRL'FLAG = 5 THEN DOC'INTERUPT = "X"     !![27]
RETURN

ADD'DOC'RECORD:
        DOC'TYPE = 1                                    !Batch type (1,2,3)
        DOC'YEAR = BAT'YEAR                             !Year
        DOC'BATCH = BAT'BATCH                           !Batch Number
        DOC'PERIOD = BAT'PERIOD                         !Period

!!UPDATE HHS WITH NEW INVOICE NUMBER BEFORE ADDING INVOICE!!!!!!!
        HHS'INV'YN = "N"                !!CLEAR FLAG
        HHS'INTERNAL = DOC'INVOICE      !!SET INVOICE NUMBER
        HHS'YEAR = BAT'YEAR
        HHS'PERIOD = BAT'PERIOD

!!Malvern - After Malvern we do not run an end of day manifest rpt
MAP1 THIS'UDT,B,4
        CALL UPDATE'MANIFEST    !!Verify that every BOX'REC has a tracking #
        HHS'MAN'DTT = DATE
        HHS'MAN'YN = "U"
        \S'TO'U THIS'UDT
        HHS'MAN'UDT = THIS'UDT

        UPDATE HHS FROM HHS'REC         !!UPDATE BEFORE ADDING DOC
                                        !!SO DEL'OLD'DOC BEHAVES ...
!!ADD NEW INVOICE
        DOC'TRN = LAST'TRN                              !Transaction Number
        DO
                IF ORG'TRN = 0 THEN                     !![25]
                        DOC'TRN = DOC'TRN + 1
                ELSE
                        DOC'TRN = ORG'TRN
                ENDIF
                \CNVDOC NPRE="DOC'ORG" DPRE="DOC"       !Orginal Document Number
                \SETKEY PRE="DOC" MODE="KEY" APP="AR"
!![9]          ADD DOC FROM DOC'REC KEY DOC'KEY
                ADDL DOC FROM DOC'REC KEY DOC'KEY           !![9]
        LOOP UNTIL DOC'CTL = 0 OR DOC'TRN > 9999
        IF DOC'CTL # 0 THEN
                REL BAT
                CALL GET'BATCH
                GOTO ADD'DOC'RECORD
        ENDIF
        LAST'TRN = DOC'TRN
!![9]  RDLOCK DOC INTO DOC'REC KEY DOC'KEY
!!DO THIS ASAP
        BAT'COUNT = BAT'COUNT + 1
        BAT'TOTAL = BAT'TOTAL + DOC'AMT
        UPDATE BAT SAV'BAT'RCN FROM BAT'REC
!!AND THIS ASAP
!!      CALL ADD'AGE
!![8]   IF DOC'PO = "" THEN DOC'PO = DOC'ORG'NO USING "###########"
        IF DOC'PO = "" THEN DOC'PO = DOC'ORG'NO USING "############"    !![8]
        \SETKEY PRE="DOC" MODE="KY2" BAD1="DOCD" BAD2="DOCC" BAD3="DOCP" BAD4="DOCL" APP="AR"
        ADDKEY DOCA
        ADDKEY DOCO
        ADDKEY DOCI
        ADDKEY DOCV
        DO UNTIL DOCV'CTL = 0 OR NEW'INTERNAL = 0
                NEW'INTERNAL = 0
                CALL SET'NEW'INTERNAL
                DOC'INVOICE = NEW'INTERNAL
                \SETKEY PRE="DOCV" MODE="KEY" APID="AR"
                ADDKEY DOCV
                IF DOCV'CTL = 0 THEN
                        HHS'INTERNAL = DOC'INVOICE      !!SET INVOICE NUMBER
                        UPDATE HHS FROM HHS'REC
                ENDIF
        LOOP
!!      DOC'CMG'NO = HHS'CMG'NO         !![29]
        UPDATE DOC FROM DOC'REC
        CALL ADD'ALWAYS'TAD
RETURN

\COPYF ATQ CV
\COPYF ATQ CV ATQ2

!!EDIT ROUTINES FOR INVOICE IN WGA AND OE1SHP AND CANCEL/REPLACE
!!
!!

CREATE'CREDIT'APPLY'TOS:
        IF UCS(HHS'PO[-1,-1]) = "R" THEN
            DOCI'KCUS'NO = HHS'NAM'NO
            DOCI'KPO = HHS'PO[1,-2]
            USE DOCI INTO DOC'REC KEY DOCI'KEY
            DOCV'CTL = DOCI'CTL
        ELSE
            DOCV'KINV'TYPE = HHS'PO[1;1]
            DOCV'KINVOICE = HHS'PO[3,-1]
            USE DOCV INTO DOC2'REC KEY DOCV'KEY
        ENDIF
        IF DOCV'CTL = 0 AND DOC'CUS'NO = DOC2'CUS'NO THEN
!![64] - credit card stuff
CIF COMMENTS AND NOT COMMENTS THEN
        if both are credit card authorized or settled we return with no noise
a)              ACTUALLY - we should process if both settled ... like
                when we did a "59" authorize and we have marked them
                both settled we need to do this apply.

b)              ACTUALLY - if debit is settled and this is "A" then
                we need to skip (this means that oe2cre should not
                squeak either about debit being paid). F8 INDICATING APPLY?

LEGAL CASES:

        DEBIT           CREDIT
STATUS    P               A             VISA OR MC (MARK CREDIT AUTHORIZED,
                                              SETTLE CREDIT)
STATUS    P               P             VISA (AUTHORIZED CREDIT, MARKED BOTH
                                              SETTLED)
STATUS    A               A             MC (MARKED CREDIT AUTHORIZED,
                                              SETTLE BOTH)

!!ABOVE ONLY VALID CASES??????  REMEMBER THIS AFTER OERCTL \VAUTH!!!!

        if mismatched ... what to do ... one choice is that the
                original was a credit card and this is not or
                vice-versa - we should scream ... and not apply?

        it is not possible for this to be settled unless it is case "a)"
                above because cv1atb won't settle until doc exists and
                we have yet to create doc for the credit (or are doing
                so now)!
ENDCIF
                IF TRH'CTP'NO # 0 THEN
MAP1 DOC2'SOURCE,S,2
                        DOC2'SOURCE = HHS'SOURCE
                        \UCNVATQ AKEY="Y" PRE="DOC2"
                        ATQT2'KEY = ATQT'KEY
                        ATQ2'STATUS = "U"
                        USE ATQT2 INTO ATQ2'REC KEY ATQT2'KEY   !!debit (apply to)
                        \UCNVATQ AKEY="Y" VIN="A"
                        ATQ'STATUS = "U"
                        USE ATQT INTO ATQ'REC KEY ATQT'KEY      !!credit (us)
!!case a)
                        IF ATQ'STATUS = "P" THEN
                                IF ATQ2'STATUS # "P" THEN
!!"P" and "U"
!!"P" and "A"
                                        ENTRY = "Very weird status mismatch!"
                                        \HDRERR
                                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                                        CALL DO'ERRL
                                        ENTRY = "Application skipped!"
                                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                                        GOTO DO'ERRL
                                ENDIF
!!"P" and "P"
                                IF ATQ'ELECTRONIC # "N" THEN
                                        GOTO APPLY'IT   !!Both settled - do apply.
                                ELSE
                                        MSG'DID = "ARMSG"
                                        MSG'SPACE = SPACE
                                        MSG'DATA = "Applied to invoice "+HHS'PO
                                        ADD MSG FROM MSG'REC
                                        DOC'MSGNO = MSG'RCN
                                        UPDATE DOC FROM DOC'REC
                                        RETURN
                                ENDIF
                        ENDIF
!!case b)
                        IF ATQ'STATUS = "A" AND ATQ2'STATUS = "P" THEN
!!"A" and "P"
                                MSG'DID = "ARMSG"
                                MSG'SPACE = SPACE
                                MSG'DATA = "Applied to invoice "+HHS'PO
                                ADD MSG FROM MSG'REC
                                DOC'MSGNO = MSG'RCN
                                UPDATE DOC FROM DOC'REC
                                RETURN
                        ENDIF
                        IF ATQ'STATUS = "A" AND ATQ2'STATUS = "A" THEN
!!"A" and "A"
                                MSG'DID = "ARMSG"
                                MSG'SPACE = SPACE
                                MSG'DATA = "Applied to invoice "+HHS'PO
                                ADD MSG FROM MSG'REC
                                DOC'MSGNO = MSG'RCN
                                UPDATE DOC FROM DOC'REC
                                IF FROM'OE2CRE # "Y" THEN
                                    RETURN
                                ENDIF
                        ENDIF

                        IF ATQ'STATUS = "U" AND (ATQ2'STATUS = "A" OR &
                                                 ATQ2'STATUS = "P") THEN
!!"U" and "A"
!!"U" and "P"
!!"U" and "U"
!!It should not be possible for the credit to be status "U" at this point.
                                ENTRY = "Credit should not have unprocessed status!"
                                \HDRERR
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                                ENTRY = "Application skipped!"
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                                GOTO DO'ERRL
                        ENDIF
                        IF ATQ2'STATUS = "U" THEN
!!"A" and "U"
!!It should not be possible for the debit to be status "U" at this point.
                                ENTRY = "Debit should not have unprocessed status!"
                                \HDRERR
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""            !![blm]
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                                ENTRY = "Application skipped!"
                                GOTO DO'ERRL
                        ENDIF
!![2] NO - This will be the case for MC transactions, since credit
!!     authorization is not allowed.
!![2]                   IF ATQ'STATUS = "A" AND ATQ2'STATUS = "A" THEN
!!"A" and "A"
!!In this case OERCTL should have settled both
!!                              ENTRY = "Status error - Debit and Credit should be P and are A"
!!                              \HDRERR
!!                              CALL DO'ERRL
!!                              ENTRY = "Application skipped on this trash!"
!!                              GOTO DO'ERRL
!![2]                   ENDIF
                ENDIF
        APPLY'IT:
                CMN'SPACE = SPACE
                CMN'TO'PRGNAM = "AR1OEU"
                CMN'FRM'PRGNAM = "APLTWP"               !![6]
                XCR'INV'TYPE = DOC'INV'TYPE
                XCR'INVOICE = DOC'INVOICE
                XDR'INV'TYPE = HHS'PO[1;1]
                XDR'INVOICE = HHS'PO[3,-1]
                BALANCE = 0
                \SETKEY DOCA APID="AR" ALTPRE="DOC2"
                USE DOCA INTO DOC2'REC KEY DOCA'KEY
                DO
                        GETNXT DOCA INTO DOC2'REC
                        \CHKKEY DOCA APID="AR" ALTPRE="DOC2"
                        IF DOCA'CTL # 0 EXIT
                        IF DOC2'TYPE = 2 THEN
                                DOC2'AMT = -DOC2'AMT
                        ENDIF
                        BALANCE = BALANCE + DOC2'AMT
                LOOP
                XAPL'AMT = (-DOC'AMT) MIN BALANCE
                IF XAPL'AMT = 0 THEN
                        ENTRY = "Cannot apply credit"
                        \KERROR HDR MODE="D" CNO="N" APID="OE"
                        ENTRY = ENTRY + " - no balance on "+HHS'PO
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                        CALL DO'ERRL
                ELSE
                        XAPL'DTT = DOC'DTT
                        XAPL'CUS'NO = DOC'CUS'NO
                        APL'SOURCE = "OE"
                        CMN'OTHER = CMN'EXTRA
                        XCALL ABUTIL,6,"AR",UB'SYS,"",FLAG
                        IF FLAG # 0 THEN
                                ENTRY = "Error logging to A/R!"
                                CALL DO'ERR
                        ELSE
!!This program - AR1OEU - actually does application give CMN'EXTRA data.
                                SNDCMN CMN'REC
                                IF V''SYSTEM="UNIX" THEN
                                        XCALL SYSTEM,"run ar1oeu"
                                ELSE
                                        XCALL LINK,1,"AR1OEU"
                                ENDIF
                                GETCMN CMN'REC
                                XCALL ABUTIL,6,"OE",UB'SYS,"",FLAG
                                IF CMN'TO'PRGNAM # "GOOD" THEN
                                        ENTRY = "Bad link to AR1OEU: "+CMN'TO'PRGNAM+" Applying: "
                                        \KERROR HHS CNO="N" MODE="D" APID="OE"
                                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                                        CALL DO'ERRL
                                ENDIF
                                RDLOCK BAT SAV'BAT'RCN INTO BAT'REC
                                RDLOCK DOC INTO DOC'REC
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
       ENDIF
RETURN

CREATE'CASH'APPLICATIONS:
        UPDATE BAT SAV'BAT'RCN FROM BAT'REC
!!ADD PAYMENT RECORDS
        DOCO'RCN = 0
        DOCO'KSHIPMENT = 0
        USE DOCO INTO DOC2'REC KEY DOCO'KEY
        DO
                GETNXT DOCO INTO DOC2'REC
                \CHKKEY PRE="DOCO" ALTPRE="DOC2" APP="AR"
                IF DOCO'CTL # 0 OR                                   &
                           (DOC2'TYPE = 1 AND DOC2'YEAR = 1) EXIT       !![60]
        LOOP
        !!GOT THE UNAPPLIED
        IF DOCO'CTL = 0 THEN
                SAV'RCN = DOCO'RCN
                APPLY'AMT = HHS'OLD'CASH
MAP1 NUKED'IT,B,1                               !![3]
                NUKED'IT = 0                    !![3]
                CALL ATTEMPT'TO'USEIT           !![35]
                IF APPLY'AMT # 0 THEN           !![35]
                        CALL FIND'OR'ADD'BAT2
!![3]                   IF APPLY'ERROR # 1 THEN
                        IF APPLY'ERROR # 1 AND NUKED'IT = 0 THEN !![3]
                                DOC2'RCN = SAV'RCN      !!FOR SETKEY MACRO
                                \SETKEY PRE="DOCA" MODE="KEY" ALTPRE="DOC2" &
                                                APP="AR" ALTKEY="DOCA3"
                                USE DOCA3 INTO DOC2'REC KEY DOCA3'KEY
                                IF DOCA3'CTL # 0 THEN
                                        ENTRY = "Internal key error, DOCA3 key not found"
                                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                                        CALL DO'ERRL
                                        APPLY'ERROR = 1
                                ENDIF
                        ENDIF
                        IF APPLY'ERROR # 1 CALL ADD'CHK'RECORD
                        SAPPLY'AMT = 0                  !![50]
                        IF APPLY'ERROR # 1 CALL ADD'UNAPPLIED'PAIDS
                        IF APPLY'ERROR # 1 CALL ADD'FINAL'PAYMENT
                        REL CHK
                        IF HHS'HDR'GONE = 1 CALL UNDO'APPLIED
                        CASE
                        IF APPLY'ERROR = 1 THEN
                                ENTRY = "Could not apply cash to invoice: "
                                \HDRERR PRE="HHS" APID="OE"
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                        ELSE
                        IF APPLY'ERROR = 2 THEN
                                ENTRY = "Cash not correctly applied: "
                                \HDRERR PRE="HHS" APID="OE"
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                                HHS'OLD'CASH = HHS'OLD'CASH - APPLY'AMT !![3]
                        ENDCASE
                ENDIF
        ELSE
                ENTRY = "Cash not found to apply: "
                \HDRERR PRE="HHS" APID="OE"
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                CALL DO'ERRL
        ENDIF
        RDLOCK BAT SAV'BAT'RCN INTO BAT'REC
RETURN

UNDO'APPLIED:
        RDLOCK DOC3 SAV'RCN INTO DOC3'REC
        \SETKEY PRE="DOCO" MODE="KEY" APP="AR" ALTPRE="DOC3" ALTKEY="DOCO3"
        DELKEY DOCO3
        DOC3'HDR'LOC'NO = 0
        DOC3'HDR'NO = 0
        DOC3'DOC'TYPE  = 0
        DOC3'SHIPMENT = 0
        \SETKEY PRE="DOCI" MODE="KEY" APP="AR" ALTPRE="DOC3" ALTKEY="DOCI3"
        DELKEY DOCI3
!![21]  DOC3'PO = STR(DOC3'ORG'NO)
        \SETKEY PRE="DOCI" MODE="KEY" APP="AR" ALTPRE="DOC3" ALTKEY="DOCI3"
        ADDKEY DOCI3
        WRITE DOC3 FROM DOC3'REC
!!      REL DOC3
RETURN

ADD'CHK'RECORD:
        CHK'SPACE = SPACE
        CHK'YEAR = BAT2'YEAR
        CHK'BATCH = BAT2'BATCH
        CHK'TRN = LAST'TRN2 + 1
        LAST'TRN2 = CHK'TRN
        CHK'CUS'NO = HHS'NAM'NO                 !Customer Number
        RDLOCK ARC
        ARC'ZERO'CNT = ARC'ZERO'CNT + 1
        WRITE ARC
        CHK'CHECK'NO = "Ap:"+(ARC'ZERO'CNT USING "#####")
!![12] - Below
!!      IF OEC'IDTTO # "Y" THEN
!!              CHK'CR'DTT = DATE                       !Credit Date
!!      ELSE
!!              CHK'CR'DTT = HHS'ORDER'DTT              !Credit Date
!!      ENDIF
!![14] CHK'CR'DTT BELOW WAS DTT
        IF OEC'IDTTO = "Y" THEN
                CHK'CR'DTT = HHS'ORDER'DTT
        ELSE
        IF OEC'IDTTO = "P" THEN
                CHK'CR'DTT = HHS'PROM'DTT
        ELSE
                CHK'CR'DTT = DATE
        ENDIF
        ENDIF
!![12] - Above
!!      CHK'AMT = 0                             !Check Amount
        ENTRY = "Order:"                        !Bank Number
        \HDRERR PRE="HHS" APID="OE"
        CHK'ABA'NO = ENTRY+"-"+HHS'SHIPMENT
        CHK'CHECK'DTT = CHK'CR'DTT              !Check Date
        CHK'DOC'AMT = 0                         !Total Distributed
        CHK'DOC'DISC = 0                        !Total Dist. Discounts
        CHK'STAT = "U"                          !Status flag
        \SETKEY PRE="CHK" MODE="KEY" APP="AR"
!![9]  ADD CHK FROM CHK'REC KEY CHK'KEY
        ADDL CHK FROM CHK'REC KEY CHK'KEY       !![9]
        IF CHK'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "CANNOT ADD CHECK: "+CHK'KYEAR+"-"+CHK'KBATCH+"-"+CHK'KTRN
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                CALL DO'ERRL
                APPLY'ERROR = 1
                RETURN
        ENDIF
        \SETKEY PRE="CHK" MODE="KY2" APP="AR"
        \ADDKEY PRE="CHK" MODE="KY2" APP="AR"
!![9]  RDLOCK CHK INTO CHK'REC KEY CHK'KEY
        BAT2'COUNT = BAT2'COUNT + 1
        UPDATE BAT2 SAV'BAT2'RCN FROM BAT2'REC
RETURN

MAP1 SAPPLY'AMT,B,5                             !![50]

ADD'FINAL'PAYMENT:
        \SETKEY PRE="DOCA" MODE="KEY" APP="AR" ALTKEY="DOCA3"
        DOCA'KSEQ = -1
        RDKEY DOCA
        GETPRV DOCA
        DOCA'KEY = DOCA'KEY2
        LAST'SEQ = DOCA'KSEQ + 1
        DOC3'REC = DOC'REC                      !!THE ONE WE ADDED
!!NEW
!![50]  IF HHS'OLD'CASH > 0 AND DOC3'AMT > 0 THEN
!!              DOC3'AMT = DOC3'AMT MIN (HHS'OLD'CASH - APPLY'AMT) !!E.G. ALL
!!                                                                 !!THAT WE
!!                                                                 !!REVERSED
!!      ELSE
!!              DOC3'AMT = HHS'OLD'CASH - APPLY'AMT
!![50]  ENDIF
        DOC3'AMT = -SAPPLY'AMT                          !![50]
        IF DOC3'AMT = 0 RETURN                          !!KLUDGE
        DOC3'TYPE = 2
        DOC3'SEQ = LAST'SEQ
        DOC3'CHK'SEQ = LAST'CHK'SEQ + 1
        DOC3'CKB'NO = 0
        DOC3'CKB'CHECK = CHK'CHECK'NO
        DOC3'YEAR = BAT2'YEAR
        DOC3'BATCH = BAT2'BATCH
        DOC3'TRN = CHK'TRN
        \SETKEY PRE="DOC" MODE="KEY" ALTPRE="DOC3" APP="AR" ALTKEY="DOC3"
        ADD DOC3 FROM DOC3'REC KEY DOC3'KEY
        \SETKEY PRE="DOCA" MODE="KEY" ALTPRE="DOC3" APP="AR" ALTKEY="DOCA2"
        ADDKEY DOCA2
RETURN

MAP1 OAPPLY'AMT,B,5

ADD'UNAPPLIED'PAIDS:
!![49]  APPLY'AMT = HHS'OLD'CASH
        OAPPLY'AMT = APPLY'AMT
        GETNXT DOCA3 INTO DOC3'REC      !!BURN TYPE 1 RECORD
        DOCA'KEY = DOCA3'KEY2
        DOCA'KSEQ = -1
        RDKEY DOCA
        GETPRV DOCA
        DOCA'KEY = DOCA'KEY2
        LAST'SEQ = DOCA'KSEQ + 1
        DO
                GETNXT DOCA3 INTO DOC3'REC
                IF DOCA3'CTL # 0 OR DOCA3'KORG'NO # DOC3'ORG'NO EXIT
!!              IF DOC3'AMT <= 0 REPEAT
!!NEW
                IF SGN(DOC3'AMT) # SGN(APPLY'AMT) REPEAT
                IF DOC3'AMT > 0 THEN
                        DOC3'AMT = DOC3'AMT MIN APPLY'AMT
                ELSE
                        DOC3'AMT = DOC3'AMT MAX APPLY'AMT
                ENDIF
                DOC3'AMT = -DOC3'AMT
                DOC3'SEQ = LAST'SEQ
                LAST'SEQ = LAST'SEQ + 1
                DOC3'CKB'NO = 0
                DOC3'CKB'CHECK = CHK'CHECK'NO
                DOC3'YEAR = BAT2'YEAR
                DOC3'BATCH = BAT2'BATCH
                DOC3'TRN = CHK'TRN
                DOC3'CHK'SEQ = LAST'CHK'SEQ + 1
                LAST'CHK'SEQ = DOC3'CHK'SEQ
                \SETKEY PRE="DOC" MODE="KEY" ALTPRE="DOC3" APP="AR" ALTKEY="DOC3"
                ADD DOC3 FROM DOC3'REC KEY DOC3'KEY
                IF DOC3'CTL # 0 THEN
                        ENTRY = "CANNOT ADD PAYMENT: "
                        \DOCERR PRE="DOC3" BATCH'ERR="Y" APID="AR"
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                        CALL DO'ERRL
                        APPLY'ERROR = 2
                        REPEAT
                ENDIF
                \SETKEY PRE="DOCA" MODE="KEY" ALTPRE="DOC3" APP="AR" ALTKEY="DOCA2"
                ADDKEY DOCA2
                APPLY'AMT = APPLY'AMT + DOC3'AMT
                SAPPLY'AMT = SAPPLY'AMT + DOC3'AMT              !![50]
        LOOP UNTIL APPLY'AMT = 0
        IF APPLY'AMT # 0 THEN
                IF APPLY'ERROR # 2 THEN
                        ENTRY = "COULD NOT FIND ENOUGH CASH TO APPLY: "+ &
                                OAPPLY'AMT+" LEFT: "+APPLY'AMT
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                        CALL DO'ERRL
                        ENTRY = "CHECK SHIPPING ON: "
                        \HDRERR PRE="HHS"
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                        CALL DO'ERRL
                ENDIF
                APPLY'ERROR = 2
        ENDIF
RETURN

MAP1 USEIT,B,1                                                  !![35]

!!If possible, change the ORG'NO on the existing payment to apply it
!!to the invoice instead of creating a new type1/type2 pair to
!!accomplish the application.
ATTEMPT'TO'USEIT:                                               !![35]
        DOC2'RCN = SAV'RCN              !!FOR SETKEY MACRO
        \SETKEY PRE="DOCA" MODE="KEY" ALTPRE="DOC2" &
                                                APP="AR" ALTKEY="DOCA3"
        DOCA3'KSEQ = 1                  !!BURN TYPE 1 RECORD
        DOCA4'KEY = DOCA3'KEY                           !![62]
        USE DOCA3 INTO DOC3'REC KEY DOCA3'KEY
        DO
                GETNXT DOCA3 INTO DOC3'REC
                IF DOCA3'CTL # 0 OR DOCA3'KORG'NO # DOC3'ORG'NO EXIT
                IF SGN(DOC3'AMT) # SGN(APPLY'AMT) REPEAT
                IF DOC3'STAT = "" THEN DOC3'STAT = "U"  !![50]
                IF DOC3'STAT # "U" REPEAT
                USEIT = 0
                IF DOC3'AMT > 0 THEN
                        IF APPLY'AMT >= DOC3'AMT USEIT = 1
                ELSE
                        IF APPLY'AMT <= DOC3'AMT USEIT = 1
                ENDIF
                IF USEIT = 1 THEN
                        RDLOCK DOC3 DOCA3'RCN INTO DOC3'REC
                        \SETKEY PRE="DOCA" MODE="KEY" ALTPRE="DOC3" APP="AR" ALTKEY="DOCA2"
                        DELKEY DOCA2                    !![63]
                        DOC3'ORG'DTT = DOC'ORG'DTT
                        DOC3'ORG'DDTT = DOC'ORG'DDTT    !![48]
                        DOC3'ORG'NO = DOC'ORG'NO
!![45]                  DOC3'SEQ = LAST'SEQ
                        DOC3'INV'TYPE = DOC'INV'TYPE
                        DOC3'INVOICE = DOC'INVOICE
                        DOC3'PO = DOC'PO
                        DOC3'UGL'NO = 0                 !![63]
!![45] - below
                        \SETKEY PRE="DOCA" MODE="KEY" ALTPRE="DOC3" APP="AR"
                        DOCA'KSEQ = -1
                        RDKEY DOCA
                        GETPRV DOCA
                        DOCA'KEY = DOCA'KEY2
                        DOC3'SEQ = DOCA'KSEQ + 1
!![45] - above
                        \SETKEY PRE="DOCA" MODE="KEY" ALTPRE="DOC3" APP="AR" ALTKEY="DOCA2"
                        ADDKEY DOCA2
                        APPLY'AMT = APPLY'AMT - DOC3'AMT
                        WRITE DOC3 FROM DOC3'REC
                ENDIF
        LOOP UNTIL APPLY'AMT = 0
!![62] Below
        USE DOCA4 INTO DOC3'REC KEY DOCA4'KEY
        GETNXT DOCA4 INTO DOC3'REC
        \CHKKEY DOCA ALTPRE="DOC3" ALTKEY="DOCA4" LASTFIX="ORG'NO" APID="AR"
        !!If there are not remaining type 2's, delete the 1-1 unapplied
        IF DOCA4'CTL # 0 THEN
                DOCA4'KSEQ = 0
                RDLOCK DOCA4 INTO DOC3'REC KEY DOCA4'KEY
                IF DOCA4'CTL = 0 THEN
                        IF DOC3'YEAR # 1 THEN
                                ENTRY = "Error - This should be an unapplied.  Report to VICS. "
                                \KERROR DOCA MODE="K" APID="AR"
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                                RETURN                  !!KLUDGE!!
                        ENDIF
                        DOC4'RCN = DOCA4'RCN
                        \SETKEY PRE="DOC" MODE="ALL" BAD1="DOCA" ALTPRE="DOC3" ALTKEY="DOC4" APID="AR"
                        \DELKEY PRE="DOC" MODE="ALL" BAD1="DOCA" ALTPRE="DOC3" ALTKEY="DOC4" APID="AR"
                        DELETE DOCA4 FROM DOC3'REC KEY DOCA4'KEY
                        IF DOCA4'CTL # 0 THEN
                                ENTRY = "Unable to delete unapplied "
                                \KERROR DOCA ALTPRE="DOC3" ALTKEY="DOCA4" MODE="K" APID="AR"
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                        ELSE
                                NUKED'IT = 1                    !![3]
                                DST'KDOC'NO = DOC3'ORG'NO
                                DST'KSEQ = 0
                                \DELOOP PRE="DST" APID="AR"
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
!![62] Above
RETURN

SET'NEW'INTERNAL:                       !![53] - re-wrote it all.
        IF NEW'INTERNAL = 0 THEN
!!WE NEED TO GENERATE NEW NUMBER FOR NEW POSTING
                DO
                        RDLOCK ARC INTO ARC'REC
                        ARC'COUNTER(ARC'INV'CNT'NO(DOC'INV'TYPE)) =             &
                                ARC'COUNTER(ARC'INV'CNT'NO(DOC'INV'TYPE)) + 1
                        WRITE ARC FROM ARC'REC
                        IF ARC'COUNTER(ARC'INV'CNT'NO(DOC'INV'TYPE)) > 9999999 THEN
                                NEW'INTERNAL = 0
                                ENTRY = "Cannot generate invoice number: "+" HDR="+LOC'NO+"-"+HHS'DOC'TYPE+"-"+HHS'NO
                                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                                CALL DO'ERRL
                                GOTO ABORT
                        ENDIF
                        NEW'INTERNAL = ARC'COUNTER(ARC'INV'CNT'NO(DOC'INV'TYPE))
                        DOCV'KINV'TYPE = DOC'INV'TYPE
                        DOCV'KINVOICE = NEW'INTERNAL
                        RDKEY DOCV
                        IF DOCV'CTL # 0 THEN            !![41]
                                DHSV'KINV'TYPE = DOC'INV'TYPE
                                DHSV'KINVOICE = NEW'INTERNAL
                                RDKEY DHSV
                        ENDIF
                LOOP UNTIL DOCV'CTL # 0 AND DHSV'CTL # 0
        ELSE
!!WE NEED TO CHECK NEW NUMBER SET BY REPOST FOR VALIDITY
                DOCV'KINV'TYPE = DOC'INV'TYPE
                DOCV'KINVOICE = NEW'INTERNAL
                RDKEY DOCV

                DHSV'KINV'TYPE = DOC'INV'TYPE
                DHSV'KINVOICE = NEW'INTERNAL
                RDKEY DHSV
                IF DOCV'CTL = 0 OR DHSV'CTL = 0 THEN
                        NEW'INTERNAL = 0
                        GOTO SET'NEW'INTERNAL           !!NOT VALID
                ENDIF
                USE ARC INTO ARC'REC
                IF NEW'INTERNAL > ARC'COUNTER(ARC'INV'CNT'NO(DOC'INV'TYPE)) THEN
                        RDLOCK ARC INTO ARC'REC
                        IF NEW'INTERNAL > ARC'COUNTER(ARC'INV'CNT'NO(DOC'INV'TYPE)) THEN
                                ARC'COUNTER(ARC'INV'CNT'NO(DOC'INV'TYPE)) = NEW'INTERNAL
                                WRITE ARC FROM ARC'REC
                        ELSE
                                REL ARC
                        ENDIF
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
RETURN

MAP1 OLD'DOC'RCN,B,4

DEL'OLD'DOC:
!![47] - look hard for invoice even if keys afu.
        IF REPOSTING # 0 THEN
                DOCV'CTL = 1
                IF HHS'INTERNAL # 0 THEN
                        DOCV'KINV'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
                        DOCV'KINVOICE = HHS'INTERNAL
                        RDKEY DOCV
                ENDIF
                IF DOCV'CTL # 0 THEN
                        DOCO'RCN = -1
                        DOCO'KHDR'LOC'NO = HHS'LOC'NO
                        DOCO'KDOC'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
                        DOCO'KHDR'NO = HHS'NO
                        DOCO'KSHIPMENT = HHS'SHIPMENT
                        USE DOCO INTO DOC'REC KEY DOCO'KEY
                        DO
                                GETPRV DOCO INTO DOC'REC
                                \CHKKEY DOCO LASTFIX="SHIPMENT" APID="AR"
                                IF DOCO'CTL # 0 EXIT
                                IF HHS'INTERNAL = 0 THEN
                                        HHS'INTERNAL = DOC'INVOICE
                                ENDIF
                                \SETKEY DOCV RCN="DOCO'RCN"
                                RDKEY DOCV
                                IF DOCV'CTL # 0 THEN
                                        ADDKEY DOCV
                                ENDIF
                        LOOP UNTIL DOCV'CTL = 0
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
!![47] - above
        IF HHS'INTERNAL # 0 THEN
                DOCV'KINV'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
                DOCV'KINVOICE = HHS'INTERNAL
                USE DOCV INTO DOC'REC KEY DOCV'KEY
                !![44] Added CUS'NO = NAM'NO test
                CASE
                IF DOCV'CTL = 0 AND DOC'STAT = "U" AND DOC'CUS'NO = HHS'NAM'NO THEN
                        ORG'YEAR = DOC'YEAR             !![25]
                        ORG'PERIOD = DOC'PERIOD         !![25]
                        ORG'DTT = DOC'DTT               !![25]
                        BAT2'KTYPE = 1
                        BAT2'KYEAR = DOC'YEAR
                        BAT2'KBATCH = DOC'BATCH
!!LOCKING THIS BATCH PREVENTS OTHER USERS FROM DINKING WITH THIS INVOICE
                        RDLOCK BAT2 INTO BAT2'REC KEY BAT2'KEY
                        CALL DEL'OLD'AGE
                        CALL DEL'OLD'DST
                        \DELREC PRE="DOC" RCN="DOCV'RCN" APP="AR"
!![ESE]
!!                      ENTRY = "DEL RCN="+DOC'RCN
!!                      \KERROR DOC APID="AR" MODE="D" CNO="N"
!!                      CALL DO'ERRLO
!![ESE]
                        IF WRH'FILL'YN = "Y" THEN                       !![3]
                                NEW'INTERNAL = HHS'INTERNAL
                        ENDIF
                        IF BAT2'CTL = 0 THEN
!!NOTE:  WE DELETED REGARDLESS OF WHETHER BATCH FOUND ... BUT WE UPDATE
!!       BAT ONLY IF WE FOUND IT ...
                                ORG'BATCH = DOC'BATCH           !![25]
                                ORG'TRN = DOC'TRN               !![25]
                                BAT2'COUNT = BAT2'COUNT - 1
                                BAT2'TOTAL = BAT2'TOTAL - DOC'AMT
                                WRITE BAT2 BAT2'RCN FROM BAT2'REC
                        ENDIF
                ELSE
                IF DOCV'CTL = 0 AND DOC'STAT # "U" THEN
!!WE COULD NOT AUTO DELETE THE INVOICE - SAVE MESSAGE
                        OLD'DOC'RCN = DOCV'RCN
                ENDCASE
        ENDIF
RETURN

DEL'OLD'AGE:
        AGE'KDOC'NO = DOC'ORG'NO
        \DELOOP PRE="AGE" APP="AR" BAD="TEST'AGE"
RETURN

TEST'AGE:
        IF AGE'DOC'NO # DOC'ORG'NO THEN AGE'CTL = 3
RETURN

DEL'OLD'DST:
        DST'KDOC'NO = DOC'ORG'NO
        \DELOOP PRE="DST" APP="AR" BAD="TEST'DST"
RETURN

TEST'DST:
        IF DST'DOC'NO # DOC'ORG'NO THEN DST'CTL = 3
RETURN

FIND'OR'ADD'BAT2:
        \BATBSC DESC="O/E Deposit/Applied" APID="AR" PAY="Y" PRGNAM="OEPDOC"    &
                DTT="DATE" SOURCE="OE" OCCUR="3" TRN="CHK" BTYPE="2"    &
                MACT="ARC'CMACT" PTC="ARC'CPTC" CST="ARC'CCST"          &
                CKB'NO="ARC'CKB'NO" LAST'TRN="LAST'TRN2"                &
                GET'BATCH="GET'BATCH2" NPRE="BAT2" MODE="MOD'MODE"      &
                FIND'MODE="""A"""
        SAV'BAT2'RCN = BAT2'RCN
        IF BAT2'CTL # 0 THEN
                APPLY'ERROR = 1
                ENTRY = "CANNOT ADD BATCH: "+BAT2'KTYPE+"-"+BAT2'KYEAR+"-"+BAT2'KBATCH
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                CALL DO'ERRL
        ENDIF
RETURN

MAP1 SAVSTX2'LOC'NO,B,3

GET'STX2:
        IF STX2'NO # STX2'KNO OR SAVSTX2'LOC'NO # STX2'KLOC'NO OR STX2'CTL # 0 THEN
                SAVSTX2'LOC'NO = STX2'KLOC'NO
                USE STX2 INTO STX2'REC KEY STX2'KEY
                IF STX2'CTL # 0 THEN
                        STX2'KLOC'NO = 0
                        USE STX2 INTO STX2'REC KEY STX2'KEY
                ENDIF
        ENDIF
RETURN

COPY    "CVTAPA[SA]"            !!CONVERT'APA:

MAP1 TSTSTX,S,1

COPY "TTLSTX",TST'TAXABLE="TSTSTX"       !!COMPUTE'TTL'STX'PERC:, GET'SF'TAXABLE:
COPY "TTLSTX",PRE="STX2",TST'TAXABLE="TSTSTX"  !!COMPUTE'TTL'STX2'PERC:

!!COPYF "WGAFIL",=WGA7          !![40] - remove compute nets subroutine.
MAP1  TMP,B,5

FIND'PRH:                                       !![11] - add caching.
        \VUSEPRH FLDNAM="PRH'KTRK'NO" SKIP'MAP="Y"
RETURN

!![47] - below try to use old doc rec even if posted.

DEL'OLD'DOC'ERROR:
        MSG'DID = "ARMSG"
        RDLOCK DOC OLD'DOC'RCN INTO DOC'REC
        ENTRY = ""
        \HDRERR PRE="HHS" APID="OE"
        ENTRY = "DUPLICATED BY: "+ENTRY+" USER: "+UB'UID
        IF DOC'MSGNO = 0 THEN
                MSG'SPACE = SPACE
                MSG'DATA = ENTRY
                ADD MSG
                DOC'MSGNO = MSG'RCN
                WRITE DOC
        ELSE
                USE MSG DOC'MSGNO INTO MSG'REC
                DO UNTIL MSG'CH = 0
                        USE MSG MSG'CH INTO MSG'REC
                LOOP
                REL DOC
                DOCV'RCN = MSG'RCN
                MSG'SPACE = SPACE
                MSG'DATA = ENTRY
                ADD MSG
                DOC'RCN = MSG'RCN
                RDLOCK MSG DOCV'RCN INTO MSG'REC
                MSG'CH = DOC'RCN
                WRITE MSG
        ENDIF
        MSG'DID = "OEMSG"
!![34] - above
        ENTRY = "DUPLICATE OLD INVOICE IN A/R: "+HHS'DOC'TYPE+"-"+HHS'INTERNAL
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
        CALL DO'ERRL
        ENTRY = "UNPOST AND DELETE OLD INVOICES FOR: "
        \HDRERR PRE="HHS" APID="OE"
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
        CALL DO'ERRL
RETURN

CHECK'OLD'DOC:
        SF = 0
        DOC2'SPACE = SPACE
        USE DOC2 OLD'DOC'RCN INTO DOC2'REC
        DOC3'REC = DOC2'REC
        DOC3'INVOICE = DOC'INVOICE
        DOC3'BATCH = DOC'BATCH
        DOC3'TRN = DOC'TRN
        DOC3'STAT = DOC'STAT
        DOC3'MSGNO = DOC'MSGNO
        DOC3'ORG'NO = DOC'ORG'NO
        DOC3'PO = DOC'PO
        DOC3'CKB'CHECK = DOC'CKB'CHECK
        DOC3'OLD'PERIOD = DOC'OLD'PERIOD
        IF DOC'INTERUPT # "Y" THEN
                DOC3'INTERUPT = DOC'INTERUPT
        ENDIF
        IF DOC3'REC = DOC'REC THEN
!!We will use the old doc record ...
                DST'KDOC'NO = DOC'ORG'NO
                DST'KSEQ = 0
                USE DST INTO DST'REC KEY DST'KEY
                DO
                        GETNXT DST INTO DST'REC
                        IF DST'CTL # 0 OR DST'DOC'NO # DOC'ORG'NO EXIT
                        DST2'KEY = DST'KEY2
                        DST2'KDOC'NO = DOC2'ORG'NO
                        USE DST2 INTO DST2'REC KEY DST2'KEY
                        DST2'DOC'NO = DST'DOC'NO
                        DST2'MSGNO = DST'MSGNO
                        IF DST2'REC # DST'REC OR DST2'CTL # 0 THEN SF = 1
                LOOP UNTIL SF = 1
                IF SF = 0 THEN
!![55] - below use old invoice if posted ...
                        IF WRH'FILL'YN = "Y" OR DOC2'STAT # "U" THEN
                                NEW'INTERNAL = DOC2'INVOICE     !!old invoice #
                        ELSE
                                NEW'INTERNAL = DOC'INVOICE      !!new invoice #
                        ENDIF
                        HHS'INTERNAL = DOC'INVOICE      !!new invoice to del
                        CALL DEL'OLD'DOC                !!really new doc
                        IF WRH'FILL'YN # "Y" AND DOC2'STAT = "U" THEN
!!Want new invoice number
                                RDLOCK DOC OLD'DOC'RCN INTO DOC'REC
                                \SETKEY DOCV
                                DELKEY DOCV
                                DOC'INVOICE = NEW'INTERNAL
                                HHS'INTERNAL = DOC'INVOICE
                                \SETKEY DOCV
                                ADDKEY DOCV
                                UPDATE DOC FROM DOC'REC         !![55]
                        ENDIF
                        HHS'INTERNAL = NEW'INTERNAL
                        UPDATE HHS FROM HHS'REC
                ELSE
                        CALL DEL'OLD'DOC'ERROR
                ENDIF
        ELSE
                CALL DEL'OLD'DOC'ERROR
        ENDIF
RETURN

!![47] - above

MAP1 CTC,B,5
MAP1 IN'TB,B,1

PRE'ERTRAP:
        IF ERR(0) = 1 THEN
                CTC = CTC + 1
                IF CTC > 200 GOTO ERTRAP        !!Die if lots ...
                ENTRY = "CTRL-C pressed - will abort at a good time."
                IF IN'TB = 1 THEN
                        ?TAB(-1,A'RED) ; ENTRY ; TAB(-1,A'NORM) ; TAB(-1,9)
                ELSE
                        CALL DO'ERR
                ENDIF
                ENTRY = "CTRL-C pressed in OEPDOC: "+PRGNAM
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
                RESUME
        ENDIF
        CTC = 0
GOTO ERTRAP

DO'HDRSUM:
        \HDRSUM HHS INVOICE="DOC'AMT"
RETURN

MAP1 DO'SPACE,S
    MAP2 DO'SHIP,B,1
    MAP2 DO'BILL,B,1

ADD'ALWAYS'TAD:
    IF OEC'ALWAYS'TAD # "Y" AND OEC'ALWAYS'TAD # "B" AND &
                                            OEC'ALWAYS'TAD # "S" RETURN
    DO'SPACE = SPACE
    IF OEC'ALWAYS'TAD # "B" THEN DO'SHIP = 1
    IF OEC'ALWAYS'TAD # "S" THEN DO'BILL = 1
    TAD'KBS = "S"
    TAD'KHDR'LOC'NO = HHS'LOC'NO
    TAD'KDOC'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
    TAD'KHDR'NO = HHS'NO
    USE TAD INTO TAD'REC KEY TAD'KEY
    IF TAD'CTL = 0 THEN
        DO'SHIP = 0
        IF TAD'BOTH'YN = "Y" THEN DO'BILL = 0
    ENDIF
    IF DO'BILL = 1 THEN
        TAD'KBS = "B"
        USE TAD INTO TAD'REC KEY TAD'KEY
        IF TAD'CTL = 0 THEN
            DO'BILL = 0
            IF TAD'BOTH'YN = "Y" THEN DO'SHIP = 0
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
    IF DO'SHIP = 0 AND DO'BILL = 0 RETURN
    IF DO'BILL = 1 THEN
        \USELST HHS'NAM'NO
        CALL SET'TAD'FROM'LST
        IF HHS'SHIP'TO = 0 AND HHS'SHP'NO = 0 AND DO'SHIP = 1 THEN
            TAD'BOTH'YN = "Y"
            DO'SHIP = 0
        ELSE
            TAD'BOTH'YN = "N"
        ENDIF
        TAD'BS = "B"
        TAD'HDR'LOC'NO = HHS'LOC'NO
        TAD'DOC'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
        TAD'HDR'NO = HHS'NO
        CALL ADD'TAD'REC
    ENDIF
    IF DO'SHIP = 1 THEN
        IF HHS'SHIP'TO # 0 OR HHS'SHP'NO # 0 THEN
            IF HHS'DROP'YN = "N" THEN HHS'SHP'NO = HHS'NAM'NO
            \NTABLST PRE="CUS" FLDNAM="HHS'SHP'NO" DSP="Y"  &
                                                    ALTFLD="HHS'SHIP'TO"
            IF HHS'DROP'YN = "N" THEN HHS'SHP'NO = 0
        ELSE
            IF DO'BILL = 0 THEN
                \USELST HHS'NAM'NO
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
        CALL SET'TAD'FROM'LST
        TAD'BOTH'YN = "N"
        TAD'BS = "S"
        TAD'HDR'LOC'NO = HHS'LOC'NO
        TAD'DOC'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
        TAD'HDR'NO = HHS'NO
        CALL ADD'TAD'REC
    ENDIF
RETURN

SET'TAD'FROM'LST:
    TAD'SPACE = SPACE
    TAD'COMPANY = LST'COMPANY
    IF LST'FIRST = "" THEN
        TAD'NAME = LST'LAST
    ELSE
        TAD'NAME = LST'FIRST + " " + LST'LAST
    ENDIF
    TAD'ADDR1 = LST'ADDR1
    TAD'ADDR2 = LST'ADDR2
    TAD'CITY = LST'CITY
    TAD'ST = LST'ST
    TAD'ZIP = LST'ZIP
    TAD'COUNTRY = LST'COUNTRY
    TAD'RES'YN = LST'RES'YN
    TAD'PHONE = LST'PHONE1
    TAD'AUTO'TAD = "Y"
    TAD'BLIND'YN = HHS'SHIP'BLIND
RETURN

ADD'TAD'REC:
    \SETKEY TAD MODE="KEY"
    ADDL TAD FROM TAD'REC KEY TAD'KEY
    IF TAD'CTL = 0 THEN
        \SETKEY TAD MODE="KY2"
        \ADDKEY TAD MODE="KY2"
        REL TAD
    ELSE
        ENTRY = "Error adding TAD:"
        \KERROR TAD MODE="K" CNO="N" APID="OE"
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""  !![blm]
        CALL DO'ERRL
    ENDIF
RETURN

MAP1 FFF,F

SET'VICS'PTRS:
    \DG GETVALUE _OESETUP name_cache ENTRY
    IF ENTRY # "Y" RETURN                            !!KLUDGE
    XCALL VICSIT,7,999,"V''PTR1",V''PTR1,FFF
    XCALL VICSIT,7,999,"V''PTR2",V''PTR2,FFF
    XCALL VICSIT,7,999,"V''PTR3",V''PTR3,FFF
    XCALL VICSIT,7,999,"DGMSGPTR",DGMSGPTR,FFF
RETURN

MAP1 MON'MQID,B,4
MAP1 MON'KEY,B,2
MAP1 MON'REC
    MAP2 MON'SPACE,S
        MAP3 MON'PRGNAM,S,6
        MAP3 MON'ENTRY,S,166            !!Data message
        MAP3 MON'UDT,B,4
        MAP3 MON'NOLF,B,1
MAP1 NOLF,B,1
MAP1 VMYCTL,F

MAP1 MSP,S,20
MAP1 SPEED'T2,F
MAP1 DENTRY,S,160
MAP1 SNDMON'LOG,S,100

SNDMON:
    IF MON'MQID # 0 THEN
        MON'SPACE = SPACE
        MON'PRGNAM = "OEPDOC"
        \DG GETVALUE _OESETUP monMS MSP
        IF MSP = "Y" THEN
            MSP = STR(SPEED'T2)
            MSP = LEFT(MSP+"000000000",12)
            MON'ENTRY = MSP+":"+ENTRY
        ELSE
            MON'ENTRY = ENTRY
        ENDIF
        MON'NOLF = NOLF
        NOLF = 0
        \S'TO'U UDT="MON'UDT"
        MON'MQID = MON'MQID
        MON'KEY = 1                !!1 for sending to monitor
        \VIPCSND MON'REC DEST="MON'KEY" CTL="VMYCTL" MQID="MON'MQID"
        IF SNDMON'LOG = "" THEN
            \DG GETVALUE _UPSETUP sndmon_log SNDMON'LOG
            IF DG'CTL # 0 OR SNDMON'LOG # "Y" THEN
                SNDMON'LOG = "N"
            ENDIF
            IF SNDMON'LOG = "Y" THEN
                SNDMON'LOG = "/logs/sndmon.DAILY"
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
        IF SNDMON'LOG # "N" THEN
            \U'TO'DTT'HMS UDT="MON'UDT"
            \STRDTC DDATE="DENTRY"
            DENTRY = MON'PRGNAM+":"+MON'ENTRY+" D="+DENTRY+ &
                (HRS USING "#Z") + ":" + &
                    (MNS USING "#Z") + ":" + (SEC USING "#Z")
            \ABLOGGER DENTRY SNDMON'LOG
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
RETURN

\COPYF BOX OE MODE="PRI"
\COPYF VIA IN

UPDATE'MANIFEST:

    VIA'KNO = HHS'VIA'NO
    USE VIA INTO VIA'REC KEY VIA'KEY
    IF VIA'CTL # 0 RETURN
    IF VIA'MTYPE # "U" RETURN

    BOX'SPACE = SPACE
    BOX'HDR'LOC'NO = HHS'LOC'NO
    BOX'DOC'TYPE = HHS'DOC'TYPE
    BOX'HDR'NO = HHS'NO
    BOX'NO = 1
    BOX'SHIPMENT = HHS'SHIPMENT
    \SETKEY BOX MODE="KEY" APID="OE"
    USE BOX INTO BOX'REC KEY BOX'KEY
    DO
        GETNXT BOX INTO BOX'REC
        IF BOX'CTL # 0 EXIT
        IF BOX'HDR'LOC'NO # HHS'LOC'NO OR BOX'DOC'TYPE # HHS'DOC'TYPE OR &
            BOX'HDR'NO # HHS'NO EXIT

        IF BOX'TRACK'NO = "" THEN
            ENTRY = ""
            \KERROR BOX
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " Missing tracking number for box - Manifest date not set"
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY """/debug/oepdoc_debug.DAILY"""
            CALL DO'ERRLO
        ENDIF
    LOOP
RETURN
